<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="MRK" style="id">- Rohingya Bible</book>
  <para style="h">Mark</para>
  <para style="toc1">Markor Leka Kušir Hóbor</para>
  <para style="toc2">Mark</para>
  <para style="toc3">Mk</para>
  <para style="mt1">Markor leka Kušir hóbor</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="MRK 1"/>
  <para style="s">Torikotor gusol doya Yahya</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 3:1-12">Moti 3:1-12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:1-18">Luk 3:1-18</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 1:19-28">Yuhunna 1:19-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 1:1"/>Allar Fut, Isa Mosir kušir hóboror babute šuru, <verse eid="MRK 1:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 1:2"/>Esaiyah nobir kitabot iyan zendilla leka ase:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 1:2">"Sa, ãi tor age ãr hóborguware defeṛair,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 1:2">hite tor age zai tolla fõt saf goribo."<verse eid="MRK 1:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 1:3"/>"Bošoti sara elehat ek abaze guzori zanai der,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 1:3">'Tũwara Mabudor fõt ṭik goro,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 1:3">hibar rasta uzu goro.'"<verse eid="MRK 1:3"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 1:4"/>He mozin torikotor gusol doya Yahyaye bošoti sara elehat hazir oiye edde guna maf faibolla gunattu mon firaito edde torikotor gusol loito hoiye. <verse eid="MRK 1:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 1:5"/>Ehudiya beggullattu edde Zeruzalemor hár kiye niyoliyore hibar hãse giye. Hitara hitarar guna okkolore šikar goijje edde Zordan halot hibattu torikotor gusol loiye. <verse eid="MRK 1:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 1:6"/>Yahyaye uṛor kẽšor hoor findito edde kĩyailot ekkan samorar duwali takito, ar hibaye firing edde fahari modu háiyore zibon haṛaiye. <verse eid="MRK 1:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 1:7"/>Hibaye endilla hoi tobolig goijje: "Ãi bade en ekzon aiyer ze ãttũwaro šoktiwala, edde ãi niyuriyore hibar zutar fita kúlidibar laikka o ãi no. <verse eid="MRK 1:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 1:8"/>Ãi tũwarare fani loi torikotor gusol diyi, kintu hibaye tũwarare he Pak Ruh loi torikotor gusol dibo."<verse eid="MRK 1:8"/></para>
  <para style="s">Isar torikotor gusol edde dúha</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 3:13-17">Moti 3:13-17</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 4:11">4:11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:21-22">Luk 3:21-22</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:1-13">4:1-13</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 1:32-34">Yuhunna 1:32-34</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 1:9"/>He šomot Isaye Galilor Nasarat farattu aišše, edde Yahyattu Zordan halot torikotor gusol loiye. <verse eid="MRK 1:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 1:10"/>Hibaye fanittu uṛer mottor, asman fáṛi bag oiye edde dekedde Pak Ruh hoitoror ḍoilla oi hibar uwore lami aiyer. <verse eid="MRK 1:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 1:11"/>Ar behostottu ei hota funa giye: "Tui ãr he adoijja Fut, tor uwore ãi kub kuši."<verse eid="MRK 1:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 1:12"/>Iyar bade he Ruhuye hibare bošoti sara elehat loigiye, <verse eid="MRK 1:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 1:13"/>ar hiba heṛe sališ din aššil edde šoitane dúha diye. Hiba heṛe fahari zanuwar okkolor fũwati aššil, edde hibare firista okkole šeba goijje.<verse eid="MRK 1:13"/></para>
  <para style="s">Isaye hibar ham šuru goijje</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 4:12-17">Moti 4:12-17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:14-15">Luk 4:14-15</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 1:14"/>Yahyare ziyolot diya oi bade, Isaye Galilot aišše edde Allar kušir hóbor tobolig goijje. <verse eid="MRK 1:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 1:15"/>Hibaye hodde: <char style="wj">"Ṭaim oiye, Allar raijjo tũwarar hãse aišše.Tũwara mon firo edde ei kušir hóbor biššaš goro."</char><verse eid="MRK 1:15"/></para>
  <para style="s">He foila sahabi okkol</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 4:18-22">Moti 4:18-22</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:1-11">Luk 5:1-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 1:16"/>Ek bar hibaye Galil doriyar hãsa bai gil, hen šomot hibaye Simon edde hitar bái Anderiyaze doriyat zal feledde deikke, kiyollahoile hitara aššilde zailla. <verse eid="MRK 1:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 1:17"/>Isaye hodde, <char style="wj">"Aiyo, ãr fisa lo, toi ãi tũwarare manuš doribar zailla banaiyum"</char> <verse eid="MRK 1:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 1:18"/>Hehon hitara hitarar zal okkol felai raki Isar fisa loiye.<verse eid="MRK 1:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 1:19"/>Toi hentu ar hoddur mummikka zaiyore Sebdeusor futain Yakub edde hitar bái Yuhannare deikke, hitara not boiyore zal baz gorer. <verse eid="MRK 1:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 1:20"/>Toi hitarare deki mottor hibaye ḍak diye, ar hitara hitarar baf Sebdeusore muzur okkolor fũwati not diyore bade itara Isar fisa loiye.<verse eid="MRK 1:20"/></para>
  <para style="s">Isaye Kofornahumot bod ruh dafaiye</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:14-17">Moti 8:14–17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:31-41">Luk 4:31–41</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 1:21"/>Tarfore hitara Kofornahumot aišše, toi bade zehon dórmo din oiye, Isaye sinagogot giye edde šikka diye. <verse eid="MRK 1:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 1:22"/>Isar šikkat beggune tajjuf oiye, kiyollahoile hibaye alem okkolor ḍoilla gori šikka no de bolke hibaye hitarare kemota loi šikka diye. <verse eid="MRK 1:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 1:23"/>Ehon, heṛe hitarar muzolišhanar butore bod ruhuye faiya ekzon manuš aššil. Hite ḍak mari hodde, <verse eid="MRK 1:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 1:24"/>"Oh, Nasarator Isa, õne loi ãrar loi ki talukkat? Õne ki ãrare naš goitto aiššo? Ãi zani õne honnuwa, õne to Allar he Pak zon!"<verse eid="MRK 1:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 1:25"/>Kintu Isaye hitare dõk diyore hodde,<char style="wj">"Nizam o, ei manušwar butottu niyoli ai."</char><verse eid="MRK 1:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 1:26"/>Toi he bod ruhuye manušware doro gori musori doijje edde zure guzori hitar butottu niyoli giyegoi. <verse eid="MRK 1:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 1:27"/>Ei hanḍo deki beggune tajjuf oiye edde hitara nizor butore howahoi goijje edde hodde, "In ki? Ek noya šikka, kemota loi! Hibaye bod ruh okkolore hokum de, ar hitara hibar hota mane." <verse eid="MRK 1:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 1:28"/>Toi hibar babute hóbor beši toratori Galil elehar hár mikka sorai giyegoi.<verse eid="MRK 1:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 1:29"/>Bade hitara muzolišhanattu niyoli zaigoi mottor, hitara Simon edde Anderiyazor górot giye. Yakub edde Yuhanna o hitarar fũwati aššil. <verse eid="MRK 1:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 1:30"/>Heṛe Simonor hori zor biyaram loi bisanat fori taikke. Isa aišše mottor hitara hiyan hibare hoiye. <verse eid="MRK 1:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 1:31"/>Toi Isa hibar ḍake zaiyore hibare hate dori tuille, henot hibattu zor sari giyegoi, ar hibaye hitarare mehemandari goijje.<verse eid="MRK 1:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 1:32"/>Beil ḍufigiyegoi edde hazinna oiye, manušzon okkole har biyaraimma okkolore edde bod ruhuye faiya manuš okkolore Isar hãse ainne. <verse eid="MRK 1:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 1:33"/>ar šohor ṭĩya aiyore dorozar munttu dola oiye. <verse eid="MRK 1:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 1:34"/>Isaye hár ḍoilla biyaraimma okkolore aram goijje edde bod ruh dafaiye. Kintu hibaye bod ruh okkolore hono hota hoito no de, kiyollahoile hiba Moside hiyan hitara zainto.<verse eid="MRK 1:34"/></para>
  <para style="s">Isaye duwa gorer edde tobolig gorer</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 1:35"/>Tarforor din binna sore, andar takite Isaye uiṭṭe edde niyoli ekkan nirzon zagat giye, zeṛe hibaye duwa goijje. <verse eid="MRK 1:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 1:36"/>Kintu Simon edde hitara Isare tuwaito giye, <verse eid="MRK 1:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 1:37"/>toi hitara hibare tuwai faiyore hodde, "Beggune õnor talaš gorer!"<verse eid="MRK 1:37"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 1:38"/>Isaye hitarare hodde, <char style="wj">"Aiyo, ãra eṛiyar ate hãsor fara okkolot zai, zene ãi heṛe o tobolig gori fari, hiyanolla to ãi aiššiyi."</char> <verse eid="MRK 1:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 1:39"/>Toi hibaye Galilor hár mikka giye, sinagog okkolot šikka diye, edde bod ruh okkolore dafaiye.<verse eid="MRK 1:39"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ek kurus biyaraimmare Isaye aram goijje</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:2-4">Moti 8:2–4</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:12-16">Luk 5:12–16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 1:40"/>Ek kurus biyaraimmaye Isar hãse aiyore hibar sarme fot uite fori foriyad goijje, "Õne issa gorile ãre foriškar gori fariba."<verse eid="MRK 1:40"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 1:41"/>Manušwalla Isattu doya oiye, hat barai di hitare suiyore hodde, <char style="wj">"Ãi sai, tũi foriškar o!"</char> <verse eid="MRK 1:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 1:42"/>Ar hehon hitattu kurus sari giyegoi edde hite foriškar oiye.<verse eid="MRK 1:42"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 1:43"/>Isaye hitare hora gori nišod goijje edde en hoiyore hehon dũrai diye: <verse eid="MRK 1:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 1:44"/><char style="wj">"Ei hota honokiyore no hois. Kintu zaiyore dórmiyo alem okkolore dehagoi, ar foriškar oi faijjosde hiyanolla Musar ain mozin kurbani gorgoi. Henot hitarar hãse tui foriškar oiyosde hiyanor forman oibo."</char><verse eid="MRK 1:44"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 1:45"/>Kintu manušwaye zaiyore hár zagat ei hóbor en bafe sorai diye, ziyanor zoriya Isaye ar hono ekkan šohorot kulasa gori goli no fare, kintu baire nirzon zagat taikke. Tarfore o hár zagattu manuš okkol hibar hãse aišše.<verse eid="MRK 1:45"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="MRK 2"/>
  <para style="s">Ãtur biyaraimma aram oiye</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 9:1-8">Moti 9:1–8</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:17-26">Luk 5:17–26</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 2:1"/>Hoekdin bade, Isaye zehon abar Kofornahumot aišše, edde hiba górot asede funa giye. <verse eid="MRK 2:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 2:2"/>Toi eto manuš dola oiye, dorozar bare udda ar zaga nu aššil. Hibaye hitarare kalam tobolig goijjede šomot, <verse eid="MRK 2:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 2:3"/>ekzon ãtur biyaraimmare loi hoekzon manuš hibar hãse aišše, manušware sairzone boi ainne, <verse eid="MRK 2:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 2:4"/>kintu zamila buli hitara hitare Isar hãse loizai no fare, hetolla Isa zeṛe aššil he borabor hitara góror salor uwore uiṭṭe edde ekkan fõt goijje, ar ze bisanar uwore ãtur biyaraimmawa aššil, hiyanor uwore gori hitare nise lamai diye. <verse eid="MRK 2:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 2:5"/>Hitarar biššaš dekiyore, Isaye he ãtur manušware hodde, <char style="wj">"Fuwa, tor guna okkol maf gora oiye."</char><verse eid="MRK 2:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 2:6"/>Heṛe hoekzon alem boiṛa aššil edde hitara nize nize bafa šuru goijje, <verse eid="MRK 2:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 2:7"/>"Ei manušwaye endilla kiyolla hor? Hite kuferi gorer, šude Allah bade ar honokiye guna maf gori di no fare?"<verse eid="MRK 2:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 2:8"/>Hitara in okkol bafedde Isaye hibar dilor butore hehon buzi faijje, edde hibaye hitarare hodde,<char style="wj">"Tũwara dilot hendilla kiyolla sinta goror?</char> <verse eid="MRK 2:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 2:9"/><char style="wj">Ei ãtur biyaraimmare honnan howa asan oibo, 'tor guna maf gora oiye', ne naki 'tui uṭ, tor bisana lo edde aṭ'?</char> <verse eid="MRK 2:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 2:10"/><char style="wj">Kintu duniyait guna maf gori dibar kemota Adomor fuwattu ase, hiyan zene tũwara zani faro."</char> Hen hoi Isaye he leng manušware hodde, <verse eid="MRK 2:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 2:11"/><char style="wj">"Ãi tore hoir, uṭ, bisana tuli loiyore gór zagoi."</char> <verse eid="MRK 2:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 2:12"/>Hetunot hite uṛi hitar bisana tuli loiye edde beggunor sarmottu baire niyoli giyegoi. Henot beggune tajjuf oiye edde hitara Allar tarif goriyore hodde, "Ãra endilla ar hono oktot no deki."<verse eid="MRK 2:12"/></para>
  <para style="s">Levire Isar fisa loibolla ḍaikke</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 9:9-13">Moti 9:9–13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:27-32">Luk 5:27–32</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 2:13"/>Isaye abar niyoliyore doriyar farot giye, heṛe beši manuš okkol hibar hãse aišše, toi hibaye hitarare šikka diye. <verse eid="MRK 2:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 2:14"/>Tarfore hibaye fõt bai zat maze dekedde Alfeyusor fuwa Levi hazna adai gorede zagat boiṛa, Isaye hitare hodde, <char style="wj">"Ãr fisa lo"</char> Toi Leviye uiṭṭe edde hibar fisa loiye.<verse eid="MRK 2:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 2:15"/>Tarfore Isaye hitar górot gorba giye, ar heṛe bout hazna adaigoroya okkol edde gunagar manuš okkol, Isa edde hibar sahabi okkolor fũwati hánar ṭebilot boišše, kiyollahoile boute aššil zara hibar fisa loil. <verse eid="MRK 2:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 2:16"/>Foroši dolor alem okkole zehon Isa hazna adaigoroya edde gunagar manuš okkolor fũwati hána hadde deikke, hitara sahabi okkolore hodde, "Hibaye hazna adaigoroya edde gunagar okkolor fũwati kiyolla hána hár?"<verse eid="MRK 2:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 2:17"/>Isaye ei hota fuinne edde hitarare hodde, <char style="wj">"Araimma mainšottu ḍakṭoror dorhar nai, kintu biyaraimma mainšottu dorhar ase. Ãi forhesgar okkolore no, kintu gunagar okkolore ḍakito aišši."</char><verse eid="MRK 2:17"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ruzar babute šikka</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 9:14-17">Moti 9:14–17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:33-39">Luk 5:33–39</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 2:18"/>Foroši okkole edde Yahyar šagirit okkole ruza rakkil. Toi hoekzone Isar hãse aiyore fusar goijje, "Foroši edde Yahyar šagirit okkole ruza rake, kintu õnor sahabi okkole kiyolla hen no gore?"<verse eid="MRK 2:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 2:19"/>Isaye hitarare hodde, <char style="wj">"Dula fũwati taite kengori dular fũwajja okkole ruza raki faribo? Dula zetodin hitarar fũwati ase, hitara ruza raki no faribo.</char> <verse eid="MRK 2:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 2:20"/><char style="wj">Kintu en šomoi aiyer, zẽtte hitarar hãsottu dulare loi zaiboi, edde toi he dinot hitara ruza rakibo."</char><verse eid="MRK 2:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 2:21"/>
    <char style="wj">"Honokiye furan kurutat noya horor tali no sila. Kiyollahoile, he furan kurutattu noya taligan siri aibo, ar henot hanagan aro ḍõr oibo.</char> <verse eid="MRK 2:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 2:22"/><char style="wj">Ar furan samorar hoillat honokiye tottoza šoraf no ḍale, kiyollahoile ḍalile šorafgune hoillagunore o fuṛaifelaibo, henot šoraf edde hoilla dunigun borbat oi zaiboi. No, tottoza šoraf noya samorar hoillat!"</char><verse eid="MRK 2:22"/></para>
  <para style="s">Isa edde dórmor din</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:1-14">Moti 12:1–14</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 6:1-11">Luk 6:1–11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 2:23"/>Hono ek dórmor din Isaye fõtot hono ek gĩyuketi bai gil, ar hibar sahabi okkole ãṛi zat maze giyũrdanar sora sijje. <verse eid="MRK 2:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 2:24"/>Henot Foroši okkole hodde, "So, ain mozin dórmor din zin gora mana hitara hin kiyolla gorer?"<verse eid="MRK 2:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 2:25"/>Hibaye hitarare hodde: <char style="wj">"Daud edde hibar fũwajja okkolottu zehon buk laggil edde haiddor obaf aššil hẽtte hibaye ki goijje, hin tũwara honodin no foro?</char> <verse eid="MRK 2:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 2:26"/><char style="wj">Obiyator ḍõr imam aššilde ṭaimot, hibaye Allar górot goillil edde sarme rakkilde ruṭi háil, zin šude imam okkol sara ar honokiye háibar mana aššil. Hibaye aro hibar sãti okkolore o dil."</char><verse eid="MRK 2:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 2:27"/>Isaye hitarare aro hodde, <char style="wj">"Manušolla dórmodin gora oiyede, kintu dórmor dinolla manuš gora no o.</char> <verse eid="MRK 2:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 2:28"/><char style="wj">Hetolla Adomor Fut oilde dórmogóror uwore o malik."</char><verse eid="MRK 2:28"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="MRK 3"/>
  <para style="s">Isaye dórmor din aram gore</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 3:1"/>Hiba abar sinagogot góille, ar heṛe ekzon hat mozigiyegoide manuš aššil. <verse eid="MRK 3:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 3:2"/>Dórmor din Isaye hitare aram gore ne naki no gore hiyan saibolla hodune hibar uwore bala gori nozor raikke, toi zene hitara hibar berudde hosuri di fare. <verse eid="MRK 3:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 3:3"/>He hat mozigiyegoide manušware Isaye hodde, <char style="wj">"Uṛi beggunor munttu ai tiya!"</char> Henot hite uṛi tiyaiye.<verse eid="MRK 3:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 3:4"/>Toi hibaye hitarare fusar goredde: <char style="wj">"Dórmor din ki gora ezajot ase? Bala ham gora ne naki horaf ham gora? Foran basa ne naki foran dongšo gora?"</char> Kintu hitara nizam mari taikke.<verse eid="MRK 3:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 3:5"/>Isaye hitarar sairo mikka gušša gori saiye edde hitarar dil dorode dekiyore hibar dilor beši murot ferešan oiye, edde manušware hodde, <char style="wj">"Tor hattan mum mikka ṭan."</char> Hite hen goijjebar hitar hattan ekkubare bala oi giyegoi. <verse eid="MRK 3:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 3:6"/>Hetunot Foroši okkol baire giye edde Isare kene marifela za he babute Herudor dolor loi felain goijje.<verse eid="MRK 3:6"/></para>
  <para style="s">Mainšor dol okkole Isar fisa loiye</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 4:23-25">Moti 4:23-25</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 6:17-19">Luk 6:17-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 3:7"/>Isaye sahabi okkolore fũwati loi lamat doriyar hãsat giye edde Galilottu ek ḍõr mainšor dole hibar fisa loiye. <verse eid="MRK 3:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 3:8"/>Ar Ehudiyattu, Zeruzalemottu edde Idumiyattu, Zordanor dusora farottu edde Tiros edde Sidon elehar sairo mikkar zaga okkolottu beši manuš okkol, hibaye ze hár ham okkol goijje hin funiyore hibar hãse aišše. <verse eid="MRK 3:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 3:9"/>Toi hibaye sahabi okkolore hiballa ekkan no ṭik gori rakito hoiye, zene mainše hibare suibolla ṭelaṭeli gori hibar uwore no foregai. <verse eid="MRK 3:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 3:10"/>Kiyollahoile hibaye bout manuš okkolore aram goijjil, hetolla biyaraimma okkole hibare suibolla mummikka ṭelaṭeli goijje. <verse eid="MRK 3:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 3:11"/>Napak ruh okkole zẽtte hibare dekito, hibar sarme meṛi uite fori guzori hoito, "Õne Allar Fut." <verse eid="MRK 3:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 3:12"/>Kintu hibaye hitarare kub hora gori hokum dito, zene hiba honnuwa hiyan hitara honokiyore no ho.<verse eid="MRK 3:12"/></para>
  <para style="s">Isaye he barozonore asab oibolla basona goijje</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:1-4">Moti 10:1-4</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 6:12-16">Luk 6:12-16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 3:13"/>Tarfore hiba faharot uiṭṭegoi edde nizor issaye kissu manušore ḍaikke. Ar hitara hibar hãse giye. <verse eid="MRK 3:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 3:14"/>Hibaye barozonore asab basona goijje zene hitara hibar fũwati fũwati take edde hibaye hitarare toboligot defeṛai fare, <verse eid="MRK 3:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 3:15"/>edde bod ruh dafaibolla šokti fa. <verse eid="MRK 3:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 3:16"/>Ze barozonore basi loiye hitara oilde:</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="MRK 3:16">Simon (Zare hibaye Fitor nam diye.)<verse eid="MRK 3:16"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 3:17"/>Sebudiyusor dui fuwa Yakub edde Yuhanna, (ar ei duizonore hibaye nam diye Buwanerges, zar mani ṭaṛalor futain)<verse eid="MRK 3:17"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 3:18"/>Anderiyaz,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="MRK 3:18">Filip,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="MRK 3:18">Bartolomeus,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="MRK 3:18">Moti,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="MRK 3:18">Tomas,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="MRK 3:18">Alfeyusor fuwa Yakub,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="MRK 3:18">Táddeyus,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="MRK 3:18">Simon Zelot,<verse eid="MRK 3:18"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 3:19"/>Edde Ehudah Iskariyot, ze Isa loi beimani goijje.<verse eid="MRK 3:19"/></para>
  <para style="s">Isa Mosi edde butor raza</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:22-32">Moti 12:22-32</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 11:14-23">Luk 11:14-23</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 3:20"/>Tarfore zehon hiba górot aišše, abar manuš okkol dola oiye, hetolla hiba edde hibar sahabi okkole kissu hái no fare. <verse eid="MRK 3:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 3:21"/>Isar nizor manuš okkole ei hóbor faiyore hibare henttu niyolai loi aišše. Hitara hodde, "Iba fool oigiyegoi."<verse eid="MRK 3:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 3:22"/>Zeruzalemottu aiššede alem okkole hodde, "Hitar butore Belsebul ase! Butor raza Belsebulor modote ite but bair gore."<verse eid="MRK 3:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 3:23"/>Toi Isaye hitarare hibar hãse ḍaikke edde hitarare mesal kahani okkol loi hota hoiye: <char style="wj">"Šoitane kengori Šoitanore dafai faribo?</char> <verse eid="MRK 3:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 3:24"/><char style="wj">Zodi raijjo ekkan nizor butore bag o, hiyan ṭiki tai no fare.</char> <verse eid="MRK 3:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 3:25"/><char style="wj">Abar, zodi ekkan gór nizor butore bag o, toile he górgan o ṭiki tai no fare.</char> <verse eid="MRK 3:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 3:26"/><char style="wj">Ar ehon, zodi šoitane hitar nizor berudde tiya edde hitar nizor butore bag o, toile hite ṭiki tai no faribo. Hite heddurot šeš.</char> <verse eid="MRK 3:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 3:27"/><char style="wj">Kintu honokiye bolwala mainšor górot goli hitar dón šombotti luṭ gori no faribo, age zodi hite he bolwala manušware bandi no fele. Zodi bande, toi hitar górgan luṭ gori faribo.</char> <verse eid="MRK 3:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 3:28"/><char style="wj">Ãi tũwarare soiyi hoir, mainšor hár ḍoilla guna edde kuferi maf gora oibo,</char> <verse eid="MRK 3:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 3:29"/><char style="wj">kintu ze honokiye Pak Ruhor berudde kuferi gore, hitarare hono din maf gora no oibo, bolke hite azibon gunar dai tai zaiboi."</char><verse eid="MRK 3:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 3:30"/>"Hibar butore ek napak ruh ase" hitara hen hoilde hetolla hibaye ei hota hoiyede.<verse eid="MRK 3:30"/></para>
  <para style="s">Isar ma báiboinain hontara?</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:46-50">Moti 12:46-50</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:19-21">Luk 8:19-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 3:31"/>Tarfore hibar ma edde báiboinain okkol aišše. Hitara baire tiyai taki Isare aibolla hóbor defeṛaiye. <verse eid="MRK 3:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 3:32"/>Isar sairo ḍakottu hẽtte ek ḍõr mainšor dol boiṛa aššil. Hitara hodde, "Õnor ma báiboinain okkol baire, edde õnor talaš gorer."<verse eid="MRK 3:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 3:33"/>Isaye hodde, <char style="wj">"Ãr ma, báiboinain hontara?"</char><verse eid="MRK 3:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 3:34"/>Zara hibar sairo ḍakottu boišše, hitarar uzu saiyore hodde,<char style="wj">"So, itara oilde ãr ma, báiboinain okkol!</char> <verse eid="MRK 3:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 3:35"/><char style="wj">Kiyollahoile ze honokiye Allar issa falon gore, hitara oilde ãr bái, boin edde ma."</char><verse eid="MRK 3:35"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 3"/>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="MRK 4"/>
  <para style="s">Ekzon sašar mesal kahani</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:1-23">Moti 13:1–23</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:4-15">Luk 8:4–15</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 4:1"/>Isaye abar lamat doriyar hãsat manuš okkolore šikka diya šuru goijje. Hibar sairo ḍakottu eto beši ḍõr ek mainšor dol zoma oiye, hibaye halot ekkan not zai boiššegoi, ar manuš okkol doriyar farot tiyai aššil.<verse eid="MRK 4:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 4:2"/>Hibaye mesal kahanir duwara bout kissur babute šikka diye edde hinor butore hibaye hodde, <verse eid="MRK 4:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 4:3"/><char style="wj">"Funo! Ekzon sašaye bizor dana šiṛibolla giye.</char> <verse eid="MRK 4:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 4:4"/><char style="wj">Biz šiṛibar šomot, hodun biz fõtor kinare foijje, ar hin faik okkole aiyore háifelaiye.</char> <verse eid="MRK 4:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 4:5"/><char style="wj">Ar hodun biz šil meṛir uwore foijje, zeṛe beši meṛi nuaššil. Meṛi mur nuaššil boli hin toratori fuṛi uiṭṭe.</char> <verse eid="MRK 4:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 4:6"/><char style="wj">Kintu beil zehon uiṭṭe, hin hiṛa oigiyegoi edde šiyõr no takonor zoriya fuwai giyegoi.</char> <verse eid="MRK 4:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 4:7"/><char style="wj">Abar hodun biz keṛarzaliwala zagat foijje, keṛarzali bari uiṭṭe, hinore sibi dori raikke, hetolla hinot gula no dore.</char> <verse eid="MRK 4:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 4:8"/><char style="wj">Kintu abar hodun biz bala zobinot foijje edde fuṛi uiṭṭe edde gula doijje, kissuye ekšot gun, kissuye haiṭ gun, ar kissuye tiriš gun."</char><verse eid="MRK 4:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 4:9"/>Toi hibaye hodde, <char style="wj">"Zattu funibar han ase hite funok!"</char><verse eid="MRK 4:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 4:10"/>Hiba zẽtte ekela oiye, he barozon asab edde aro zara fũwati aššil hitara he mesal kahaniganor babute hibattu fusar goijje. <verse eid="MRK 4:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 4:11"/>Isaye hitarare hodde, <char style="wj">"Allar raijjor gufon soiyi tũwarare zanibolla šuzug diya oiye. Kintu zara baire ase hitaralla hár kissu mesal kahanir duwara howa oiye, </char> <verse eid="MRK 4:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 4:12"/><char style="wj">toi zene,</char></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 4:12">
    <char style="wj">"'hitara sa kintu no deke,</char></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 4:12">
    <char style="wj">ar fune kintu no buze.</char></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 4:12">
    <char style="wj">Ar no oile hitara Allar mikka firito edde maf gori diya oito.'"</char><verse eid="MRK 4:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 4:13"/>Tarfore Isaye hodde, <char style="wj">"Tũwara zehon ei mesal kahanigan no buzor, toile kengori oinno mesalgunor mani buziba?</char> <verse eid="MRK 4:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 4:14"/><char style="wj">Sašaye šittede hin Allar kalam.</char> <verse eid="MRK 4:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 4:15"/><char style="wj">Fõtor kinarorgun oilde endilla manuš, zara kalam heṛe šiṭṭe, kintu zehon hin fuinna oiye, toi hehon šoitan aiyore hitarar butore ziyan šittil hiyan tuli loi zagoi.</char> <verse eid="MRK 4:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 4:16"/><char style="wj">Hendilla ekkui bafe zin šil meṛiwala zagat šiṛa oiye, hitara oilde hitara, zitara kalam fune edde toratori kuši mone hin gose.</char> <verse eid="MRK 4:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 4:17"/><char style="wj">Kintu hitarar butore šiyõr bala gori no boiye, hitara olfo dinolla tim take. Bade kalamolla boli zehon zulum aiye hetunot hitara fissa fori zagoi.</char> <verse eid="MRK 4:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 4:18"/><char style="wj">Abar zin keṛar zaliwalat šiṛa oiye, itara oilde hitara, zara kalam fune,</char> <verse eid="MRK 4:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 4:19"/><char style="wj">kintu duniyaibi šongšari sinta bafona, dón šombottir maya edde aro oinno hár ziniš okkolor lalsi aiyore he kalamore sibi dore, hetolla hibat hono gula no dore.</char> <verse eid="MRK 4:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 4:20"/><char style="wj">Kintu zin bala zobinot šiṛa oiye, hitara oilde hitara, zara kalam fune edde hin gose, ar tirišgun, haiṭgun ar kissuye ek šotgun gula dora." </char><verse eid="MRK 4:20"/></para>
  <para style="s">Boiṛonir uwore serag</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 8:16-18">Luk 8:16–18</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 4:21"/>Isaye aro hodde,<char style="wj">"Ekzon zẽtte serag loi butore aiye, hiyan ki ugguwa laiyor nise otóba haṭor tole rake? Hiyan ki boiṛonir uwore no rakibo ne?</char> <verse eid="MRK 4:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 4:22"/><char style="wj">Kiyollahoile hono kissu lukaiya nai, zin forhaš no oi no takibo. Abar hono kissu gufon no takibo, kiyollahoile heṛe fohor aibo.</char> <verse eid="MRK 4:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 4:23"/><char style="wj">Zodi honokiyottu funibolla han take, toile hite funok!"</char><verse eid="MRK 4:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 4:24"/>Toi Isaye hodde, <char style="wj">"Tũwara zin funor he babute diyan do! Zendilla mafoni loi tũwara mafo, tũwaralla o hendilla gori mafa oibo, bolke aro beši tũwarare diya oibo.</char> <verse eid="MRK 4:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 4:25"/><char style="wj">Kiyollahoile zattu ase, hitare aro diya oibo, kintu zattu nai, hitattu zin ase hin o loifela oibo."</char><verse eid="MRK 4:25"/></para>
  <para style="s">Bizor mesal kahani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 4:26"/>Hibaye aro hodde,<char style="wj">"Allar raijjo oilde endilla. Ekzon manuše zobinot biz šiṭṭe.</char> <verse eid="MRK 4:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 4:27"/><char style="wj">Bade hite gum zar edde gumottu uṛer, rait or edde din or, eṛe bizottu šem fuṛer edde bari uṛer, kintu hin kengori or hin hite hoi no fare.</char> <verse eid="MRK 4:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 4:28"/><char style="wj">Onegane zobinottu fodai gorer, foila sara, tarfore túr, bade túrottu sórat maze furafuri fõna dana.</char> <verse eid="MRK 4:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 4:29"/><char style="wj">Dana zehon faikke, hite hinot haši golai de, kiyollahoile hin daibar ṭaim oiye."</char><verse eid="MRK 4:29"/></para>
  <para style="s">Horoir danar mesal kahani</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:31-32">Moti 13:31–32</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 13:18-19">Luk 13:18–19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 4:30"/>Abar hibaye hodde,<char style="wj">"Ãra ki loi Allar raijjor tulona goriyum? Hon mesal kahani hoiyore hiyan buzaiyum?</char> <verse eid="MRK 4:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 4:31"/><char style="wj">Hiyan uggwa horoir danar ḍoilla, ziba šiṛibar šomot duniyair hár dana okkolottuwaro šoṛo,</char> <verse eid="MRK 4:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 4:32"/><char style="wj">kintu hiba zehon laga o, hiba bari uṛe edde ketor hár sara okkolottuwaro ḍõr o edde en ḍõr ḍõr ḍeila okkol fuṛe, asmanor faik okkole hibar sabar tole baha bande."</char><verse eid="MRK 4:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 4:33"/>Endilla aro bout mesal kahani okkol loi hibaye hitarar buz mozin hitare kalam hoito. <verse eid="MRK 4:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 4:34"/>Mesal kahani sara hibaye hitarare hono kissu no hoito, kintu zẽtte hibar nizor sahabi okkol loi ekela oito, hẽtte hibaye beggun hitarare buzai dito.<verse eid="MRK 4:34"/></para>
  <para style="s">Isaye tuwan tamaiye</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:23-27">Moti 8:23–27</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:22-25">Luk 8:22–25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 4:35"/>He din zẽtte hazinna oiye, hibaye sahabi okkolore hodde, <char style="wj">"Solo, ãra doriyar ofarot zai." </char><verse eid="MRK 4:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 4:36"/>Hetunot mainšor dolore fissa felai rakiyore hitara Isa ze not boišše hiyanot gori loiye, aro dusora no okkol o hibar fũwati aššil. <verse eid="MRK 4:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 4:37"/>Bade kub beši bári ek tuwan uiṭṭe edde goiror fani nor butore foijje, toi nogan faniye furaiya owa šuru goijje. <verse eid="MRK 4:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 4:38"/>Hẽtte Isa nor fis mikka balušor uwore gum giye. Hitara hibare ḍaki diyore hodde, "Ustad, ãra ḍufi zairgoide ki õne kiyal no goror ne?"<verse eid="MRK 4:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 4:39"/>Toi hiba uiṭṭe, boyarore dõk diye edde doriyare hodde,<char style="wj">"Nizam, šanti o."</char> Henot boyar tamigiyegoi edde hár kissu hehon nizam oigiyegoi.<verse eid="MRK 4:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 4:40"/>Hibaye sahabi okkolore hodde, <char style="wj">"Tũwara eto ḍoror kiyolla? Tũwarattu ehon o biššaš no o neki?"</char><verse eid="MRK 4:40"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 4:41"/>Toi hitara beša beši ḍoraiye edde ekzonore ekzone hodde, "Iba honnuwa? Boyar edde doriyar goire udda hibare mane!"<verse eid="MRK 4:41"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 4"/>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="MRK 5"/>
  <para style="s">Hoboror gãtor manušwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:28-34">Moti 8:28–34</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:26-39">Luk 8:26–39</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 5:1"/>Tarfore hitara doriyar dusora farot Geraseni okkolor dešot aišše. <verse eid="MRK 5:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 5:2"/>Isaye nottu laimme mottor, napak ruhuye faiya ekzon manuš hoboror gãtottu niyoliyore hibar muntu aiššiye. <verse eid="MRK 5:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 5:3"/>Ei manušwa hoboror gãt okkolot takito edde hitare honokiye bandi raki no farito, enki siyol loi udda no. <verse eid="MRK 5:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 5:4"/>Kiyollahoile hitar hãt ṭeng hamiša beri edde siyol loi bandi raka oito, kintu hite siyol sirifelaito edde ṭengor beri bangi ṭura ṭura gorifelaito. Hitare honokiye samali no farito. <verse eid="MRK 5:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 5:5"/>Hite dine raite hoboror gãt okkolot edde faharot guzori guri beraito edde fattor diyore nize nizor ga haṛito.<verse eid="MRK 5:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 5:6"/>Isare durottu dekiyore hite dũri aišše edde hibar fõt uite foijje <verse eid="MRK 5:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 5:7"/>edde guzori hodde, "Oh beši ḍõr šoktiwala Allar Fut, Isa, ãr loi õnor ki tallukat? Allar name duhai, õne ãre zala zontrona no diyo." <verse eid="MRK 5:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 5:8"/>Ei hota hoiyede moksud oilde Isaye hitare hoiye, <char style="wj">"Tui napak ruh, ei manušwar butottu niyoli ai."</char><verse eid="MRK 5:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 5:9"/>Tarfore Isaye hitare fusar goijje, <char style="wj">"Tor nam ki?"</char></para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 5:9">Hite hodde, "Ãr nam Bahini, kiyollahoile ãra beši." <verse eid="MRK 5:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 5:10"/>Toi he elehattu hitarare niyolai no dibolla hite bar bar fori dori Isar hãse foriyad goijje.<verse eid="MRK 5:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 5:11"/>Heṛe faharor hãsat ḍõr ek šuworor zak soredde aššil. <verse eid="MRK 5:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 5:12"/>Ar he napak ruh okkole fori dori foriyad gorilo, "Ãrare oi šuworgunor butore defeṛo, toi zene ãra hin okkolor butore goli fari." <verse eid="MRK 5:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 5:13"/>Hibaye hitarare ezajot diye edde napak ruh okkol niyoli aiyore šuworgunor butore góille. Toi he šuworor zak, homsehom dui hazar oibo, hin okkol zure dũri faharor haindat giye edde doriyat fori fanit dufi moijje.<verse eid="MRK 5:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 5:14"/>Šuwor soroya okkole hentu dai giyegoi edde farat edde heṛiyar ato hãse sairo mikka ei hóbor hoiyegoi, toi manuš okkole ki goṭṭil hin saito aišše. <verse eid="MRK 5:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 5:15"/>Hitara zẽtte Isar hãse aišše, dekedde oi napak ruhuye failde manušwa hor findi šuida oi boi roiye, henot hitarattu ḍore doijje. <verse eid="MRK 5:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 5:16"/>Zara ei goṭonagan dekkil, hitara he napak ruhuye failde manušwar edde šuworgunor ki halot oiye he babute mainšore zanaiye. <verse eid="MRK 5:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 5:17"/>Henot manuš okkole Isare fori dori hoiye zene hiba hitarar eleha sari zagoi.<verse eid="MRK 5:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 5:18"/>Toi Isa not giye, ar napak ruhuye failde manušwaye hibar fũwati zaibolla foriyad goijje. <verse eid="MRK 5:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 5:19"/>Kintu Isaye hitare ezajot no de edde en hoiye, <char style="wj">"Tui tor góror nizor mainšor heṛe firizagoi edde tolla Mabude ze ham goijje edde tor uwore hoto doya dehaiye hin beggun hitarare hogoi."</char> <verse eid="MRK 5:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 5:20"/>Toi hite hentu giyegoi edde Isaye hitalla zin goijje hin beggun Dekapolis elehat howa šuru goijje. Henot manuš okkol tajjuf oiye.<verse eid="MRK 5:20"/></para>
  <para style="s">Zairusor zi edde ze mayafuwaye Isar hor suiye</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 9:18-26">Moti 9:18–26</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:40-56">Luk 8:40–56</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 5:21"/>Isaye zẽtte abar no loi doriyar dusora farot gil, hẽtte hibar sairo ḍakottu ek mainšor ḍõr dol dola oil. Hiba hehon o doriyar farot, <verse eid="MRK 5:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 5:22"/>hen šomot Zairus name ekzon muzolišhanar neta heṛe aišše. Hite Isare dekiyore hibar ṭengot uite foijje. <verse eid="MRK 5:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 5:23"/>edde fori dori foriyad goijje, "Ãr zi morar fõtot, õne aiyore hibar uwore hat rakogai toi hiba aram oi faribo edde basibo." <verse eid="MRK 5:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 5:24"/>Toi Isa hitar fũwati giye.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 5:24">Ar ek ḍõr mainšor dol o fise fise gil edde hibar sairo ḍakottu ṭelaṭeli goijjil. <verse eid="MRK 5:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 5:25"/>Heṛe butore ekzon beṛi maya fuwa aššil ze baro bosorfan kunzari loi duk fat ase. <verse eid="MRK 5:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 5:26"/>Bout ḍakṭor okkolor hatot hibaye bout hošṭo faiye. Ar hibattu ze kissu aššil hin beggun horos gori felaiye bade o hono kissu no o, aram oibar bodole aro beši oigiyegoi. <verse eid="MRK 5:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 5:27"/>Hibaye Isar babute fuinne edde he mainšor dolor butore hibar fisottu aiyore hibar saddorgan suiye. <verse eid="MRK 5:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 5:28"/>Kiyollahoile hibaye baffil, "Zodi ãi šude hibar hor sui fari, toile ãi aram oi zaiyumboi." <verse eid="MRK 5:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 5:29"/>Ar hehon hibar kunzari bondo oiye edde hibaye hibar gar butore buzi faijje ze hiba aram oiye.<verse eid="MRK 5:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 5:30"/>Isaye hetunot buzi faijje ze hibar butottu šokti giye, hetolla hibaye mainšor dolor uzu saiyore hodde, <char style="wj">"Ãr hor hone suiye?"</char><verse eid="MRK 5:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 5:31"/>Sahabi okkole hodde, "Õne dekor, õnore loi mainše kengori ṭelaṭeli gorer, ar tarfore o õne hoor, õnore hone suiye!"<verse eid="MRK 5:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 5:32"/>Kintu ei ham hone goijje hiyan saibolla Isaye sairo mikka saiye. <verse eid="MRK 5:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 5:33"/>Mayafuwawattu ken oiye buzi fariyore, hibaye ḍore hafi hafi Isar sarme uite foijje edde hibaye hár goṭonare hibare zanaiye. <verse eid="MRK 5:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 5:34"/>Isaye hibare hodde: <char style="wj">"Oh zi, tor biššaše tore bala goijje, šantiye zagoi, tor ei duk bug gorodde hentu tui azad"</char><verse eid="MRK 5:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 5:35"/>Isa ehon o hota howat ase, hen šomot muzolišhanar netar górottu manuš aiyore hodde, "Tũwar zi mori giyoi. Ustadore loi aro kiyolla diddari gora forer?"<verse eid="MRK 5:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 5:36"/>Hitarar hota funiyore Isaye muzolišhanar netaware hodde, <char style="wj">"No ḍorais, šude biššaš gor."</char><verse eid="MRK 5:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 5:37"/>Ehon, hibaye Fitor, Yakub edde Yakubor bái Yuhanna, hitarare bade ar honokiyore fũwati zaito no de. <verse eid="MRK 5:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 5:38"/>Bade hitara zehon muzolišhanar netar górot aišše heṛe dekedde uzora uzori oiye, edde manuš okkole handa haṛi gorer edde bilag gorer. <verse eid="MRK 5:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 5:39"/>Isaye butore zai mainšore hodde,<char style="wj">"Tũwara uzora uzori edde handa haṛi kiyolla goror? Hiba no more, gum zadde."</char><verse eid="MRK 5:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 5:40"/>Hitara hibar hotat hãšše.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 5:40">Toi hibaye beggunore góttu bare niyolai diye. He zerfuwar ma bab edde hibar sãti okkolore loiyore zerfuwawa zeṛe aššil heṛe butore góille. <verse eid="MRK 5:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 5:41"/>Tarfore hibaye zerfuwaware hate doriyore hodde, <char style="wj">"Talita Kumi!"</char>ziyanor mani <char style="wj">"Gura zi, tore hoir, uṭ!"</char> <verse eid="MRK 5:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 5:42"/>Ar hehon zerfuwawa uṛi tiyaiye edde aṛi bera šuru goijje. (Hibar boyoš aššilde baro bosor.) Ar hitara beggune kub beši ammuwak oiye. <verse eid="MRK 5:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 5:43"/>Kintu hibaye hora gori hokum diye zene ei babute honokiye no zane edde zerfuwaware hono kissu haito dibolla hoiye.<verse eid="MRK 5:43"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 5"/>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="MRK 6"/>
  <para style="s">Nobi okkole nizor fara bade beggulla ijjot fa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:53-58">Moti 13:53–58</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:16-30">Luk 4:16–30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 6:1"/>Hiba henttu giyegoi edde nizor farat aišše, ar sahabi okkol o hibar fũwati aššil. <verse eid="MRK 6:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 6:2"/>Dórmor din zehon aišše, hibaye sinagogot šikka diya šuru goijje. Bout kiye zara hibar hota fuinne, hitara tajjuf oiye.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 6:2">Ar hodde, "Ei manušwaye in honttu faiye? Ei giyan in hibare diyede hiba honnuwa? Abar hibaye keramoti ham o gorer? <verse eid="MRK 6:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 6:3"/>Iba ki gas mistiri no neki? Iba ki Moriyamor fuwa no neki? Yakub, Yusuf, Ehudah edde Simonor bái no neki? Hitar boinain okkol ki eṛe ãrar fũwati no take?" Ar endilla gori Isare loi mainšor dilot šondo aišše.<verse eid="MRK 6:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 6:4"/>Hetunot Isaye hitarare hodde, <char style="wj">"Ekzon nobiye šude nizor farat, nizor egena edde nizor gór bade ar hár zagat ijjot fa."</char> <verse eid="MRK 6:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 6:5"/>Hiballa heṛe hono ḍõr keramoti ham gora šombob no o, šude hoekzon ošuikka manušor uwore hibaye hat raikke edde hitarare aram goijje. <verse eid="MRK 6:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 6:6"/>Hitarattu biššaš naide dekiyore hibaye ammuwak oiye.</para>
  <para style="s" vid="MRK 6:6">Asab okkolore tobolig goitto defeṛar</para>
  <para style="r" vid="MRK 6:6">(<ref loc="MAT 10:1">Moti 10:1</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 10:9-15">9–15</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:1-6">Luk 9:1–6</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 6:6">Tarfore Isaye sairo mikkar fara fara zai manuš okkolore šikka diya šuru goijje. <verse eid="MRK 6:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 6:7"/>Hibaye he barozon asabore hibar hãse ḍaikke edde duizon duizon gori faṭai diye, hibaye hitarare napak ruhor uwore kemota diye.<verse eid="MRK 6:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 6:8"/>In oilde hokum okkol: <char style="wj">"Baisar fõtolla šude ugguwa laṛi bade, ruṭi, gaṭṭi, zalit rufar foiša, hono kissu no loiyo.</char> <verse eid="MRK 6:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 6:9"/><char style="wj">Ṭengor šendal loiba, kintu ugguwa bazuttuwaro beši no.</char> <verse eid="MRK 6:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 6:10"/><char style="wj">Tũwara zẽtte ekkan górot goliba, he fara sari no zogoi foijjonto he górot taikko.</char> <verse eid="MRK 6:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 6:11"/><char style="wj">Ar hono zagat zodi hitara tũwarare no gose edde tũwarar hota no fune, toile he zagattu zaibar šomot ṭengor tolar dúil udda zari felaiyo zene hiyan hitarar berudde goba o."</char><verse eid="MRK 6:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 6:12"/>Toi hitara giye edde manuš okkolor hãse hitara gunattu mon firaibar babute tobolig goijje. <verse eid="MRK 6:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 6:13"/>Hitara bout napak ruh dafaiye edde bout ošuikka manuš okkolor matat tel diye, hitarare aram goijje.<verse eid="MRK 6:13"/></para>
  <para style="s">Herud edde torikotor gusoldoya Yahya</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 14:1-12">Moti 14:1–12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:7-9">Luk 9:7–9</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:19-20">Luk 3:19–20</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 6:14"/>Isar bala nam ehon zana zani oigiyegoi boli badša Herude hibar babute fuinne. Kiye kiye hodde, "Torikotor gusoldoya Yahya mora okkolor butottu uwafes zinda uiṭṭe, hetolla hibar butore keramoti šoktiye ham goredde."<verse eid="MRK 6:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 6:15"/>Ar kiye hodde, "Hiba Eliyas"</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 6:15">Ar kiye hodde, "Bout agor nobi okkolor ḍoil hiba o ekzon nobi."<verse eid="MRK 6:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 6:16"/>Kintu Herude zẽtte fuinne, hite hodde, "Hiba he Yahya, zar ãi holla loilam, hiba morattu zinda uṛi giyegoide!"<verse eid="MRK 6:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 6:17"/>Kiyollahoile ei Herud, zibaye nize Yahyare dori anibolla manuš defeṛail edde hibare bandiyore ziyolot felai rakkil. Hite iyan goijjilde oilde Herudiya, ziba aššil Herudor bái Filipor biyata bou, zibare abar Herude biya goijjil. <verse eid="MRK 6:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 6:18"/>Hiyanor zoriya Yahyaye hitare hoil, "Tor bái bouwore tui biya gora hiyan tolla ain mozin no o." <verse eid="MRK 6:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 6:19"/>Hetolla Herudiyattu Yahyar uwore beši rag taigilgoi edde hibare marifelaito sail, kintu hibaye he mozin gori no fajjil. <verse eid="MRK 6:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 6:20"/>Kiyollahoile Herude Yahya ekzon forhesgar edde Paki manušde hiyanolla boli hibare ijjot goitto edde hibare rokka goitto. Herude zẽtte Yahyar hotabatra funito, hẽtte hitar dilot beši goṭboṭ oi zaitoi, tarfore o kintu hite hibar hota funito.<verse eid="MRK 6:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 6:21"/>Šeše ek šuzug faiye. Herude hitar zormo dinor din hitar usol tokkar ofisar okkol, meliṭari komanḍar okkol edde Galilor zimmadar manuš okkol, itarare ugguwa hána diye. <verse eid="MRK 6:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 6:22"/>Herudiyar zi aiyore naisse. Herud edde hitar meheman okkolore hibaye eto kuši goijje.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 6:22">Hetunot badšaye hodde, "Tui zin sos ãi tore hin diyum?" <verse eid="MRK 6:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 6:23"/>Ar hite ziyore hosom haiyore wada goijje "Tui zin sos, ãi tore diyum, enki ãr raijjo oddok udda."<verse eid="MRK 6:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 6:24"/>Ziye zaiyore hibar mare hodde, "Ãi ki saiyum?"</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 6:24">Hibaye zuwabe hodde, "Torikotor gusoldoya Yahyar matawa."<verse eid="MRK 6:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 6:25"/>Zerfuwaye hehon zaiyore badšare hodde, "Ekkan talot gori ãi torikotor gusoldoya Yahyar matawa ehon sai."<verse eid="MRK 6:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 6:26"/>Ei hota funi badša beši ferešan oiye, kintu meheman okkolor muntu hosom háiye boli ziyor hotare no fela. <verse eid="MRK 6:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 6:27"/>Toi badšaye hehon ekzon zollatore Yahyar matawa anibolla hokum loi defeṛaiye. Toi hite ziyolhanat zaiyore Yahyar mata haṛi loiyore, <verse eid="MRK 6:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 6:28"/>ekkan talot gori loi aišše edde hiba zerfuwaware diye, bade hibaye mataware hibar mare diye.<verse eid="MRK 6:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 6:29"/>Ei hóbor hibar šagirit okkole funiyore hitar aišše edde hibar lašwa loizai ek hoborot raikkegoi.<verse eid="MRK 6:29"/></para>
  <para style="s">Isaye fãs hazar manušore hána diye</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 14:13-21">Moti 14:13–21</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:10-17">Luk 9:10–17</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 6:1-13">Yuhunna 6:1–13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 6:30"/>Asab okkol abar Isar hãse ekotro oiye edde hitara ki ki goijje hin edde manuš okkolore zin zin šikka diye hin beggunor babute hibare zanaiye. <verse eid="MRK 6:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 6:31"/>Toi, hibaye hitarare hodde, <char style="wj">"Ãr fũwati ekkan nirzon zagat aiyo zeṛe ãra alok oi faijjum edde ekka aram gorogai"</char> Kiyollahoile heṛe beša beši manuš okkol aza goijjil boli hitara hána háibar ṭaim udda no fail.<verse eid="MRK 6:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 6:32"/>Hitara not gori ekkan nirzon zagat giye. <verse eid="MRK 6:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 6:33"/>Kintu bout kiye hitara zadde dekiyore hitarare sini faijje, ar hár fara okkolottu manuš dũri age zai heṛe hazir oiyegoi. <verse eid="MRK 6:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 6:34"/>Isaye nottu zehon laimme ek ḍõr mainšor dol dekilo. Hibattu hitarar uwore beši maya oiye, kiyollahoile hitara soroya sara soolor ḍoil oiye. Toi hibaye hitarare bout kissur babute šikka diya šuru goijje.<verse eid="MRK 6:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 6:35"/>Zehon din šeš oi aiššil, hetunot sahabi okkole Isar hãse aiyore hodde, "Zagagan nirzon zaga, ar din o giyegoi. <verse eid="MRK 6:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 6:36"/>Itarare bidai gori do, zene itara ãte hasor zaga edde fara okkolot zai hána kini loi hái fare."<verse eid="MRK 6:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 6:37"/>Kintu hibaye zuwabe hitarare hodde, <char style="wj">"Tũwara hitarare hána do na"</char></para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 6:37">Hitara hodde, "Ãra ki zai dui šot dinaror ruṭi kini aniyore hitarare háito ditam neki?"<verse eid="MRK 6:37"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 6:38"/>Hibaye hitarare hodde, <char style="wj">"Tũwarattu ruṭi howa ase, zo sogoi."</char></para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 6:38">Toi hitara zai sai aiyore hodde, "Fãssuwa ruṭi edde duwa mas."<verse eid="MRK 6:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 6:39"/>Toi hibaye hitara beggunore gurup gurup gori hail keror uwore buwai dibolla hitarare hokum diye. <verse eid="MRK 6:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 6:40"/>Manuš okkole laine laine ek šot ek šot, ar kiye fõnzašzon fõnzašzon gori boigiyegoi. <verse eid="MRK 6:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 6:41"/>Toi hibaye fãswa ruṭi edde duwa mas loiyore asmanor mikka suk tui šukurana duwa zanaiye, ar ruṭigunore ṭura ṭura gori sahabi okkolor hãtot diye, zene hitara manuš okkolore hin baṛi di fare. Hendilla gori he mas duniware o hibaye bag gori diye, hitara beggunor maze baṛi dibolla. <verse eid="MRK 6:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 6:42"/>Hitara beggune feṭbori háiye. <verse eid="MRK 6:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 6:43"/>Tarfore sahabi okkole baro barang banga ruṭi edde mas feṛai loi dola goijje. <verse eid="MRK 6:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 6:44"/>Háilde hitarar butore onumanik fãs hazar morodfuwain aššil.<verse eid="MRK 6:44"/></para>
  <para style="s">Isaye fanir uwottu ãiṭṭe</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 14:22-33">Moti 14:22–33</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 6:16-21">Yuhunna 6:16–21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 6:45"/>Ar Isaye hehon hibar sahabi okkolore not uiṭṭo hoiye zene hitara hibar agottu zai dusora farot, Betsaidar mikka za, ar eṛe hiba nize manuš okkolore bidai goijje. <verse eid="MRK 6:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 6:46"/>Toi manuš okkolottu bidai loi bade hiba munazat goribolla uwore faharot giye.<verse eid="MRK 6:46"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 6:47"/>Toi zehon hazinna oiye, nogan doriyar maze aššil, hiba eṛe ekela zobinor kulot tai giyegoi. <verse eid="MRK 6:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MRK 6:48"/>Hibaye dekedde hitara beši hošṭo gori dar bar, kiyollahoile bataš hitarar uzan aššil. Dolfohor oibar age hiba doriyar uwottu ãṛiyore hitarar heṛe aišše. Hibaye hitarar ḍak bai zafan goijje. <verse eid="MRK 6:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MRK 6:49"/>Kintu hibaye fanir uwottu aṛedde dekiyore hitara but deker boli mone goijje edde kiskisai uiṭṭe, <verse eid="MRK 6:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MRK 6:50"/>Kiyollahoile hibare dekiyore beggune ḍoraiye.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 6:50">Isaye hehon hitara loi hota hoiye edde hodde,<char style="wj">"Iba ãi, no ḍoraiyo!"</char> <verse eid="MRK 6:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="MRK 6:51"/>Toi hiba hitarar not uiṭṭe edde bataš tamigiyegoi, edde hitara beši ammuwak oiye. <verse eid="MRK 6:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="MRK 6:52"/>Kiyollahoile ruṭir goṭona ziyan goṭṭil hiyan hitara buzi no fare, kiyollahoile hitarar dil doro taki gilgoi.<verse eid="MRK 6:52"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="MRK 6:53"/>Toi hitara okule zehon faraiyore Gennesaretot tiya goraiye edde nogan bainde. <verse eid="MRK 6:53"/><verse number="54" style="v" sid="MRK 6:54"/>Hitara nottu laimme mottor, manuš okkole hibare sini faijje. <verse eid="MRK 6:54"/><verse number="55" style="v" sid="MRK 6:55"/>Edde hitara he elehar butore hár mikka dũra dũri gora šuru goijje edde ošuikka manuš okkolore haiṭṭat gori hiba zeṛe ase boli fuinne heṛe ana šuru goijje. <verse eid="MRK 6:55"/><verse number="56" style="v" sid="MRK 6:56"/>Ar hiba šohorot, farat otóba geramot, hiba zeṛe giye heṛiyar manuš okkole biyaraimma okkolore aniyore bazaror butore dola goijje, ar hitara hibare foriyad goijje zene hitara šude hibar saddoror hãsagan oile sui fare. Ar zeduggune hiyan suiye, hitara beggune aram oiye.<verse eid="MRK 6:56"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 6"/>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="MRK 7"/>
  <para style="s">Manušor diya ain edde Allar diya ain</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 15:1-20">Moti 15:1–20</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 7:1"/>Ar Zeruzalemottu aiššede hoekzon Forošiye edde dormiyo aleme Isa loi dola oiye. <verse eid="MRK 7:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 7:2"/>Hitara Isar sahabi hoekzone napaki abostat mani hat no duiyore hána háito boiššede deikke. <verse eid="MRK 7:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 7:3"/>Foroši okkole, edde hár Ihudi okkole hitarar furana amolottu loti soli aiyedde niyomore maniyore, hitara hat no duiyore hána no há. <verse eid="MRK 7:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 7:4"/>Bazarottu aiyore hitara hat ṭeng no duite kissu no há. Hendilla dusora aro bout kissu hitara falon gorede ase, zenneki fiyala, gora edde tamar gala, haṭ falong, in okkolore dúwa.<verse eid="MRK 7:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 7:5"/>Toi Foroši okkole edde dormiyo alem okkole hibare suwal goijje: "Furana amolottu loti soli aiyedde niyomore kiyolla tũwar sahabi okkole no maner, kintu hitara aduiya hate ruṭi hár?"<verse eid="MRK 7:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 7:6"/>Toi hibaye hitarare zuwabe hodde, <char style="wj">"Tũwara munafek okkolor babute nobi Esaiyaye ṭik hoi giye, iyan zendilla leka ase: </char></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 7:6">
    <char style="wj">"'Ei zatiye ãre hitarar mukor uwottu šorman gore,</char></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 7:6">
    <char style="wj">kintu hitarar dil ãttu bout dure.</char><verse eid="MRK 7:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 7:7"/>
    <char style="wj">hitara ãre mani sara fũza gore,</char></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 7:7">
    <char style="wj">hitarar šikka okkol mainšor diya ain okkol.'</char><verse eid="MRK 7:7"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 7:8"/>
    <char style="wj">Allar hokumgunore bad goriyore, tũwara mainšor rosomore falon goror."</char><verse eid="MRK 7:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 7:9"/>Ar hibaye hitarare hodde,<char style="wj">"Oi, Allar hokum bad goriyore tũwarar nizor rosom salu rakibolla tũwarattu kub šundojja rasta ase!</char> <verse eid="MRK 7:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 7:10"/><char style="wj">Zendilla Musaye hoiye, 'Ma bafore šorman goro,' ar, 'Ze honokiye nizor baf mare bura hota ho hitare marifela oibo.'</char> <verse eid="MRK 7:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 7:11"/><char style="wj">Kintu tũwara ho, honokiye hitar ma otóba bafore ho, 'ãttu ze ziniš loi tolla modot oito, hin kurban' mani Allar hãse kurbani gora oiye.</char> <verse eid="MRK 7:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 7:12"/><char style="wj">Hen oile, tũwara hitare hitar baf edde malla hono kissu gorattu bad goror.</char> <verse eid="MRK 7:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 7:13"/><char style="wj">Ei bafe tũwara Allar kalamore batil goriyore tũwara ze rosom faiyo hiyanore zari raikko. Aro bout kissu ase tũwara hendilla gorode."</char><verse eid="MRK 7:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 7:14"/>Tarfore Isaye manuš okkolore abar ḍakiyore hodde, <char style="wj">"Tũwara beggune ãr hota funo edde buzo!</char> <verse eid="MRK 7:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 7:15"/><char style="wj">En hono kissu nai zin manušor butore zaiyore hitare napak gori fare, bolke zin manušor butottu niyoli aiye hine napak gore.</char> <verse eid="MRK 7:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 7:16"/><char style="wj">Zattu funibar han ase, hite funo!"</char><verse eid="MRK 7:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 7:17"/>Tarfore Isaye mainšor dolore eri górot góille, hetunot hibar sahabi okkole he mesal kahaniganor manir babute fusar goijje. <verse eid="MRK 7:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 7:18"/>Isaye hitarare hodde, <char style="wj">"Tũwara kissu no buzo? Tũwara buzi no faror ne, hono kissu zin mainšor butore gole hine hitare napak gori no farede?</char> <verse eid="MRK 7:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 7:19"/><char style="wj">Kiyollahoile, hin hitar dilot no gole, kintu feṛot za ar tarfore gar bair oi zagoi."</char> Ei hota loi Isaye buzai diye ze, hono ḍoilla hána napak nai.<verse eid="MRK 7:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 7:20"/>Hibaye aro hodde,<char style="wj">"Mainšor butottu zin niyoli aiye, hine manušore napak gore.</char> <verse eid="MRK 7:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 7:21"/><char style="wj">Kiyollahoile butottu, manušor dilor butottu, he horaf sinta okkol niyoli aiye: Beššagiri, suri, kun,</char> <verse eid="MRK 7:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 7:22"/><char style="wj">zena, lub lalsi, horafi, oinnore hotigora, dúhabazi, bíyaṛa hota, kukiyal, gibod, nizore loi ohonkari gora, bekufai.</char> <verse eid="MRK 7:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 7:23"/><char style="wj">Ei horaf in okkol beggun ekzon manušor dilor butottu niyoli aiye edde hitare napak gore."</char><verse eid="MRK 7:23"/></para>
  <para style="s">Fonikiyar mayafuwar biššaš</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 15:21-28">Moti 15:21–28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 7:24"/>Bade hiba uiṭṭe edde hentu Tiros elehat giye, heṛe hiba ek górot góille. Ar sail hiyan zene honokiye zani no fare, kintu hiba lukai taki no fare. <verse eid="MRK 7:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 7:25"/>Ar hehon ek mayafuwa, zattu ek gura zi aiššil edde napak ruhuye fail, Isar babute funiyore aišše edde hibar fõt uite foijje. <verse eid="MRK 7:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 7:26"/>He mayafuwawa aššilde Girik zuban hoiya, Siriya-Fonikiyar zormo, toi hibaye Isar hãse foriyad goijje hibaye zene hibar ziyor butottu he napak ruhure bair gori de.<verse eid="MRK 7:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 7:27"/>Kintu Isaye hibare hodde,<char style="wj">"Age futziyainde feṭ bori háok, kiyollahoile futziyaindottu ruṭi loiyore hin kũirore diya hiyan bala no."</char><verse eid="MRK 7:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 7:28"/>Toi hibaye zuwab diye edde hodde, "Oi, Malik, kintu kũir okkole o hánar ṭebilottu futziyaindor hánar guragara zin tole fore hin há."<verse eid="MRK 7:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 7:29"/>Toi Isaye hodde,<char style="wj">"Tui endilla hoiyosde hiyanolla, ãi tore hoir, tui za, tor ziyor butottu napak ruh niyoli giyegoi."</char><verse eid="MRK 7:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 7:30"/>Ar hibaye górot aiyore dekedde, ziwa bisanat neṛi taikke edde napak ruhuye sari giyegoi.<verse eid="MRK 7:30"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ek nafang edde túta manušore Isaye aram goijje</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 7:31"/>Toi abar, hibaye Tiros eleha sari Sidon šohoror butottu diyore Galil doriyar hãsa hãsi Dekapolis elehar fara okkolot giye. <verse eid="MRK 7:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 7:32"/>Heṛe hodun mainše ekzon manušore hibar hãse ainne, ze aššil nafang edde túta, ar hitar uwore hat rakibolla hitara hibar hãse foriyad goijje.<verse eid="MRK 7:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 7:33"/>Isaye he manušware mainšor dolottu ek ḍaikka loizaiyore hibaye hitar dui hanot õl diye, ar sef loiyore hitar zilot ḍoille. <verse eid="MRK 7:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 7:34"/>Tarfore hibaye asmanor mikka saiyore ek ḍor niyaš felaiye edde hitare hodde,<char style="wj">"Effata"</char> mani <char style="wj">"kuli zagoi."</char> <verse eid="MRK 7:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 7:35"/>Henot hehon manušwar han kula oigiyegoi edde alazilgan eridiya oigiyegoi, ar hite foriškar gori hota howa šuru goijje.<verse eid="MRK 7:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 7:36"/>Hibaye hitarare hokum diye zene honokiyore no ho, kintu hibaye zeto no hoito hoiye, heto hitara aro beši gori elan goijje. <verse eid="MRK 7:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 7:37"/>Manuš okkole kub beši ammuwak oiye edde tajjuf oiyore hodde, "Hibaye hár ham zin gorer hin bala. Hibaye nafange funefan edde buke hota hoi farefan gorer."<verse eid="MRK 7:37"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 7"/>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="MRK 8"/>
  <para style="s">Sair hazar manušore hána diye</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 15:32-39">Moti 15:32–39</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 8:1"/>Ar ek bar hẽtte ek ḍõr mainšor dol dola oiye, edde hitarattu háibolla kissu nu aššil. Toi Isaye sahabi okkolore hibar hãse ḍaikke edde hodde, <verse eid="MRK 8:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 8:2"/><char style="wj">"Ei manuš okkololla ãr dilot doya or, kiyollahoile itara aijja tin din dori ãr fũwati ase, ar hitarattu háibolla hono kissu nai.</char> <verse eid="MRK 8:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 8:3"/><char style="wj">Zodi ãi itarare uwašša górot defeṛai toile hitara fõtot bangi fori zaiboi, kiyollahoile eṛe kiye kiye bout durottu aiššede ase."</char><verse eid="MRK 8:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 8:4"/>Sahabi okkole hodde, "Ei nirzon zagat itarare habaibolla edun ruṭi hontu faibo?"<verse eid="MRK 8:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 8:5"/>Isaye hitarare hodde, <char style="wj">"Tũwarar hãse howa ruṭi ase?"</char></para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 8:5">Hitara zuwabe hodde, "Hãttuwa"<verse eid="MRK 8:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 8:6"/>Toi hibaye manuš okkolore meṛit boibolla hokum diye. Bade he ruṭi hãttuwa loi hibaye Allare šukuriya zanaiye, hinore bangi hibar sahabi okkolore diye zene hitara manuš okkolore baṛi de, ar hitara hinore manuš okkolore baṛi diye. <verse eid="MRK 8:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 8:7"/>Hitarattu hougguwa šoṛo mas o aššil. Hibaye hinore loi duwa goijje edde hin o hitarare baṛi dito hoiye. <verse eid="MRK 8:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 8:8"/>Ar hitara feṭ bori hái faijje, tarfore ze ṭura okkol fori roiye hin sahabi okkole tuli loiyore hãt barang oiye. <verse eid="MRK 8:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 8:9"/>Heṛe onumanik sair hazar manuš aššil. Tarfore hibaye hitarare bidai diye. <verse eid="MRK 8:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 8:10"/>Ar hibaye sahabi okkolore loi hehon not giye edde Dalmanuta elehat aišše.<verse eid="MRK 8:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 8:11"/>Foroši okkole aišše edde Isa loi barabari gora suru goijje. Hibare forikka goribolla hitara hibare behostottu ekkan sinno dehaito hoiye. <verse eid="MRK 8:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 8:12"/>Henot hibaye dilor beši murottu dukke hodde, <char style="wj">"Ei halor manuš okkole sinno kiyolla tuwa? Ãi tũwarare soiyi hoir, itarare hono sinno deha no oibo."</char> <verse eid="MRK 8:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 8:13"/>Tarfore hibaye hitarare eri zai abar not uṛi dusora farot giye.<verse eid="MRK 8:13"/></para>
  <para style="s">Išottu hũšiyar</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 16:5-12">Moti 16:5–12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 8:14"/>Kintu sahabi okkolottu ruṭi loite monot nuaššil, hitarattu šude ugguwa ruṭi bade not maze ar hono kissu no aššil. <verse eid="MRK 8:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 8:15"/>Hen šomot Isaye hodde, <char style="wj">"Tũwara hũšiyar, Foroši edde Herudor išottu šabdan taikko."</char><verse eid="MRK 8:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 8:16"/>Kintu hitara hitara howa hoi goijje: "Ãrattu ruṭi nai boli hibaye ei hota hodde."<verse eid="MRK 8:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 8:17"/>Isaye hitara ki hodde buzi fariyore hodde,<char style="wj">"Tũwarattu ruṭi naide he babute kiyolla howahoi goror? Tũwara ehono buzi no faro ne? Tũwarar dil ki koṭin oigiyegoi neki?</char> <verse eid="MRK 8:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 8:18"/><char style="wj">Tũwarattu suk takiyore o ki deki no faror? Han takiyore o ki funi no faror? Ar tũwarattu monot nai ne? </char> <verse eid="MRK 8:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 8:19"/><char style="wj">Ãi zẽtte fãs hazar manušolla fãswa ruṭi bangilam hẽtte tũwara ho barang ruṭir ṭura feṛai loi dola goijjila?"</char></para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 8:19">Hitara zuwabe hodde, "Baro barang"<verse eid="MRK 8:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 8:20"/>
    <char style="wj">"Ar ãi zẽtte he sair hazarolla hãttuwa ruṭi bangilam hẽtte tũwara ho barang ruṭir ṭura feṛai loi dola goijjila?"</char></para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 8:20">Hitara hodde "Hãt barang"<verse eid="MRK 8:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 8:21"/>Hibaye hitarare hodde, <char style="wj">"Toile tũwara ehono kissu buzi no faror?"</char><verse eid="MRK 8:21"/></para>
  <para style="s">Betsaidar anda manušwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 8:22"/>Bade hitara Betsaidat aišše, heṛe hodun mainše ekzon andare Isar hãse loi aišše, ar he manušware suibolla hibare foriyad goijje. <verse eid="MRK 8:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 8:23"/>Isaye he anda manušware hate dori farar baire loigiye. Tarfore hitar sukot sef diye edde hitar uwore hat raikke edde fusar goijje, <char style="wj">"Tui ki hono kissu dekor ne?"</char><verse eid="MRK 8:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 8:24"/>Hite saiye edde hodde, "Ãi manušore dekir, hitarare saite gasor ḍoilla, aṛerfan lager."<verse eid="MRK 8:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 8:25"/>Ar ek bar Isaye he manušwar sukor uwore hat raikke. Toi suk kuligiyegoi, ar hite aram oiye edde beggun foriškar gori deki faijje. <verse eid="MRK 8:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 8:26"/>Isaye en hoiyore hitare górot faṭai diye,<char style="wj">"Farar butore no zais."</char><verse eid="MRK 8:26"/></para>
  <para style="s">Fitore Mosi šikar gorer</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 16:13-20">Moti 16:13–20</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:18-21">Luk 9:18–21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 8:27"/>Isa edde hibar sahabi okkol Sesariyar Filifir atehasor šohoror okkolot aišše, fõtot hibaye hitarare fusar goredde, <char style="wj">"Ãi honnuwa, ei babute manuš okkole ki ho?"</char><verse eid="MRK 8:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 8:28"/>Hitara zuwabe hodde, "Torikotor gusol doya Yahya, kintu kiye kiye ho nobi Eliyas, ar kiye ho nobi okkolor butottu ek nobi."<verse eid="MRK 8:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 8:29"/>Toi hibaye hodde, <char style="wj">"Ar tũwara, tũwara ki ho ãi honnuwa?"</char></para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 8:29">Toi Fitore zuwab diye, "Õne he Mosi."<verse eid="MRK 8:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 8:30"/>Isaye hitarare hũšiyari diye zene hitara hibar babute honokiyore no ho.<verse eid="MRK 8:30"/></para>
  <para style="s">Isaye nizor moron edde uwafes zindar babute hor</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 16:13-20">Moti 16:13–20</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:18-21">Luk 9:18–21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 8:31"/>Bade Isaye hitarare šikka diya šuru goijje ze Adomor Futottu beši duk bug gora foribo edde hibare murobbi okkol, ḍõr imam okkol edde alem okkole batil goribo. Hibare mari fela oibo, edde tin dinor din bade abar uṛi zaibogoi. <verse eid="MRK 8:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 8:32"/>Hibaye ei babute kulasa gori hoiye. Toi Fitore hibare ek ḍaikka loizaiyore jejeṛaiye.<verse eid="MRK 8:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 8:33"/>Kintu Isaye firiyore sahabi okkolor mikka saiye edde Fitorore dõk diyore hodde, <char style="wj">"Šoitan, ãr hãsottu dur o, Allaye ziyan issa gorer tottu hiyanor baf nai, kintu šude manuše ziyan sa hiyan bafos."</char><verse eid="MRK 8:33"/></para>
  <para style="s">Isar fisa lowa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 16:24-28">Moti 16:24–28</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:23-27">Luk 9:23–27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 8:34"/>Toi hibaye sahabi okkol edde oinno manuš okkolore ḍakiyore hodde, <char style="wj">"Honokiye zodi ãr fise aito issa gore, hite nizore ošikar gorok edde hite fotti din nizor kuruš handot loi ãr fise fise aiyok.</char> <verse eid="MRK 8:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 8:35"/><char style="wj">Kiyollahoile ze honokiye hitar nizor zibon basaito sa hite hiyan haraibo, kintu ze kiye ãlla boli edde kušir hóborolla hitar foran hara hite hiyan basaibo.</char> <verse eid="MRK 8:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 8:36"/><char style="wj">Zodi ekzone šara duniyai hamaiye, kintu hitar asol foran haraifele, toile hitar ki lab oiye? </char> <verse eid="MRK 8:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 8:37"/><char style="wj">Ar hite ki kissu diyore asol foran hiyan uwafes firai faibolla kissu ase?</char> <verse eid="MRK 8:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 8:38"/><char style="wj">Ei halor beiman edde gunagar manuš okkolor butore zodi honokiye ãre edde ãr hota loi šorma, Adomor Fut zẽtte pak fobitro firista okkolor fũwati hibar Bafor tozolli loi aibo, hẽtte hibaye o he manuš okkolore šormaibo." </char><verse eid="MRK 8:38"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 8"/>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="MRK 9"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 9:1"/>Toi hibaye hitarare hodde, <char style="wj">"Ãi tũwarare soiyi hoir, eṛe tũwarar butore en hozon ase zara Allar raijjo beši ḍõr šokti loi aiššede no deke foijjonto hitara hono mote moutor fiyala no fibo."</char><verse eid="MRK 9:1"/></para>
  <para style="s">Isar dola fušak</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 17:1-13">Moti 17:1–13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:28-36">Luk 9:28–36</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 9:2"/>Iyar so din bade, Isaye Fitor, Yakub, edde Yuhanna, itarare fũwati loi ek usol faharor uwore giye, zeṛe hitara ekela aššil. Hitarar sarme hibar siyara bodoli giyegoi. <verse eid="MRK 9:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 9:3"/>Hibar fušak en dola oi giyegoi zenneki duniyair hono dufiye hor duiyore hendilla dola gori no faribo. <verse eid="MRK 9:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 9:4"/>Toi heṛe Musa edde Eliyase hitarare deha diyore Isa loi hota hor.<verse eid="MRK 9:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 9:5"/>Toi Fitore Isare hodde: "Ustad, ãra eṛe aside bala oiye. Ãra tinnan bãša banai, ekkan õnolla, ekkan Musalla, ar ekkan Eliyasolla."<verse eid="MRK 9:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 9:6"/>(Kintu Fitore ki hoibo hiyan hibaye buzi uṛi no faijjil, kiyollahoile hitarare beši ḍore doijjil.)<verse eid="MRK 9:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 9:7"/>Toi ekkan miyula aiyore hitarare guri felaiye, edde he miyular butottu ek abaz aišše, "Iba ãr he adoijja Fut, tũwara hibar hota funo!"<verse eid="MRK 9:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 9:8"/>Bade hehon sahabi okkole sairo mikka saiye kintu Isa sara heṛe ar honokiyore no deke.<verse eid="MRK 9:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 9:9"/>Faharottu lami aiyedde šomot, Isaye hitarare hokum diye ze hitara zin dekkil hin Adomor Fut morattu uwafes zinda no uṛe foijjonto honokiyore no ho.<verse eid="MRK 9:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 9:10"/>Hitara ei hokum mainne, edde morattu uwafes zinda uṛar mani ki hiyan hitara hitarar butore biyasana goijje.<verse eid="MRK 9:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 9:11"/>Toi hitara hibare fusar goredde, "He alem okkole kiyolla ho ze Mosi aibar age Eliyasottu aiya foribo?"<verse eid="MRK 9:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 9:12"/>Zuwabe Isaye hodde, <char style="wj">"Oi, ei hota soiyi, Eliyase age aiyore hár kissure agor abostat firai anibo. Toile endilla kiyolla leka ase ze Adomor Fute beši duk bug goribo edde hibare batil gora oibo?</char> <verse eid="MRK 9:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 9:13"/><char style="wj">Kintu ãi tũwarare hoir, Eliyasor babute pak kitabot zendilla leka ase hiba he mozin aiššil, ar hitara hibar uwore hitarar issa mozin hár kissu goijje."</char><verse eid="MRK 9:13"/></para>
  <para style="s">Isaye ek bute faiya fuware aram goijje</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 17:14-21">Moti 17:14–21</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:37-43">Luk 9:37–43</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 9:14"/>Toi hitara zẽtte he dusora sahabi okkolor hãse firi aišše, dekedde oi sahabi okkolor sairo ḍakottu ek ḍõr manuš dol zoma oiye edde hoekzon aleme hitara loi barabari diye. <verse eid="MRK 9:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 9:15"/>Mainše Isare deikke mottor hitara kub beši tajjuf oiye edde dũri zaiyore hibare solam zanaiye.<verse eid="MRK 9:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 9:16"/>Toi Isaye hitarare fusar goredde,<char style="wj">"Tũwara utara loi kiyor babute barabari goijjilade?"</char><verse eid="MRK 9:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 9:17"/>Dolor butottu ekzone zuwab diye, "Ustad, ãi ãr fuware loi õnor hãse aiššide, kiyollahoile hitare ek ruhuye faiye, zibaye hitare buk gori felaiye. <verse eid="MRK 9:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 9:18"/>Hibaye zẽtte hitare dore hetunot asari meṛit felaide. Hitar galottu fena ane ar dat loi dat goše edde ebbe doro oi zagoi. Ei ruhure dafaidibolla ãi õnor sahabi okkolore foriyad goijjilam, kintu hitara no fare."<verse eid="MRK 9:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 9:19"/>Hetunot Isaye hodde,<char style="wj">"Oh obiššaši manuš okkol! Ar hotokal ãi tũwarar fũwati takiyum, ar hotokal tũwarare bordaš goriyum? Tor fuware loi eṛe ai!"</char><verse eid="MRK 9:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 9:20"/>Toi hitara hitare ainne. Hetunot he ruhuye zehon hibare deikke, hehon kub zure musori doijje, toi fuwawa meṛit fori giyegoi edde goijja šuru goijje, ar galottu fena ainne.<verse eid="MRK 9:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 9:21"/>Isaye fuwar bafore fusar goredde, <char style="wj">"Itattu endilla oiyede hotodin oiye?"</char></para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 9:21">Manušwaye hodde, "Šoṛo halottu loti. <verse eid="MRK 9:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 9:22"/>Bout bar ei ruhuye hitare marifelaibolla oinot edde fanit felaidil. Kintu õne zodi kissu gori faribade oile, toile ãrar uwore doya deho edde modot goro."<verse eid="MRK 9:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 9:23"/>Isaye hitare hodde, <char style="wj">"'Zodi ãi gori farile mani?' Ze biššaš gore hitalla hár kissu šombob."</char><verse eid="MRK 9:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 9:24"/>Hetunot fuwar bafe guzori hodde, "Ãi biššaš gori, ãr butore ze obiššaš ase hin dur gori do!"<verse eid="MRK 9:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 9:25"/>Bout manuš okkol dũri aiyedde dekiyore Isaye he ruhure dõk diyore hodde, <char style="wj">"Oh nafang edde buk ruh, ãi tore hokum dir, hitar butottu niyol, hitar butore ar hono din no gólis."</char><verse eid="MRK 9:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 9:26"/>Hetunot ruhuye guzori fuwaware zure musori doijje edde hitar butottu niyoli giyegoi. Henot fuwawa morar ḍoil oi fori roiye edde beggune "hite morigiyegoi" boli hoiye. <verse eid="MRK 9:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 9:27"/>Kintu Isaye hitare hate doijje edde modot goijje, toi hite uṛi tiyaiye.<verse eid="MRK 9:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 9:28"/>Tarfore zehon Isaye góror butore giye, toi sahabi okkol hibar fũwati ekela aššil, hitara fusar goijje, "Ãra kiyolla ibare dafai no fari?"<verse eid="MRK 9:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 9:29"/>Isaye hodde,<char style="wj">"Endillagunore šude munazat edde ruzar duwara dafa šombob."</char><verse eid="MRK 9:29"/></para>
  <para style="s">Isaye dusora bar hibar moron edde uwafes zindar babute hor</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 17:22-23">Moti 17:22–23</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:44-45">Luk 9:44–45</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 9:30"/>Bade hitara hentu uṛi baisa diye edde Galil elehar butottu di giye ar hiyan hono kiye zani farok hibattu issa nuaššil, <verse eid="MRK 9:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 9:31"/>kiyollahoile hibaye hibar sahabi okkolore šikka diyat aššil. Hibaye hitarare hodde,<char style="wj">"Adomor Futore manuš okkolor hatot tuli diya oibo. Hitara hibare mari felaibo, ar tin dinor din hiba uṛi zaiboi."</char><verse eid="MRK 9:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 9:32"/>Kintu hibaye ki hoiye hin hitara buzi no fare ar he babute fusar goitte o ḍoraiye.<verse eid="MRK 9:32"/></para>
  <para style="s">Beggunottuwaro hone ḍõr?</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 18:1-5">Moti 18:1–5</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:46-48">Luk 9:46–48</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 9:33"/>Hitara Kofornahumot aišše, toi hitara góror butore zehon oiye, hibaye hitarare fusar goijje, <char style="wj">"Tũwara fõtot kiyor babute barabari goijjilade?"</char><verse eid="MRK 9:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 9:34"/>Kintu hitara nizam oi roiye, kiyollahoile fõtot hitara hone beggunottuwaro ḍõr he babute ekzone ekzon loi hotabartra hoil.<verse eid="MRK 9:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 9:35"/>Toi hibaye boišše edde he barozonore ḍakiyore hodde, <char style="wj">"Zodi honokiye beggunor age oito sa toile hitattu beggunor šešottu taka foribo, ar beggunor šeba goroya owa foribo."</char><verse eid="MRK 9:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 9:36"/>Bade hibaye ugguwa gura fuware loiye edde hitarar maze tiya goraiye. He gura fuwaware hibaye ãza mari loiyore hodde, <verse eid="MRK 9:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 9:37"/><char style="wj">"Ze honokiye ãr name itar ḍoilla hono gura fuware gose, hite ãre gose. Ar ze ãre gose hite šude ãre gosede no, bolke hibare gose, ze ãre defeṛaiye."</char><verse eid="MRK 9:37"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ze ãrar bifokke no hitede ãrar fokke</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:42">Moti 10:42</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 18:6-7">18:6–7</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:49-50">Luk 9:49–50</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 17:1-2">17:1–2</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 9:38"/>Yuhannaye Isare hodde, "Ustad, õnor name ekzon mainše napak ruh saradde dekkilam, hite ãrar dolot nuaššil hetolla buli ãra hitare mana goijjilam."<verse eid="MRK 9:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 9:39"/>Isaye hodde, <char style="wj">"Hitare mana no goijjo, kiyollahoile ãr name ekkan keramoti ham gori bade hehon honokiye ãr babute horaf hoi no faribo,</char> <verse eid="MRK 9:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 9:40"/><char style="wj">kiyollahoile ze ãrar bifokke no hitede ãrar fokke ase.</char> <verse eid="MRK 9:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 9:41"/><char style="wj">Ze honokiye tũwarare ek kaf fani fi haito de, kiyollahoile tũwara Mosir manušde hetolla Ãi tũwarare soiyi hoir: Hite hitar enam no haraibo.</char><verse eid="MRK 9:41"/></para>
  <para style="s">Gunar fõtot no zaibolla mojbut tako</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 18:8-10">Moti 18:8–10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 9:42"/>
    <char style="wj">"Ar ze honokiye ãr uwore biššaši ei šoṛo okkolor butottu honokiyore gunar fõtot loi za, toile hitare golat ugguwa ḍõr fattor bandi di doriyar mur fanit felai diya, bolke hitalla aro beši bala oibo.</char> <verse eid="MRK 9:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 9:43"/><char style="wj">Tũwar hate zodi tũware gunat felaito sa, toile he hat haṛi felai do. Dui hat loi jahannamot, ze oin hono din no nifibo, heṛe golattuwaro, bolke tũṛa oi akeri zibonot gola tũwalla bala oibo.</char> <verse eid="MRK 9:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 9:44"/><char style="qt">(Zeṛe log okkole hitarare hár, hin no morer, edde oinor zilha no nifer.) </char> <verse eid="MRK 9:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 9:45"/><char style="wj">Tũwar ṭenge zodi tũware gunat felaito sa, toile he ṭeng haṛi felai do. Dui ṭeng loi jahannamot feli diyattuwaro, bolke tũṛa oi akeri zibonot gola tũwalla bala oibo.</char> <verse eid="MRK 9:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 9:46"/>(Zeṛe log okkole hitarare hár, hin no morer, edde oinor zilha no nifer.) <verse eid="MRK 9:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 9:47"/><char style="wj">Tũwar ek suke zodi tũware gunar fõtot ṭane, toile hiba niyalaifelo. Dui suk loi jahannamot felaidiya oibade hiyanottuwaro, bolke ek suk loi Allar raijjot gola tũwalla aro bala oibo,</char> <verse eid="MRK 9:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MRK 9:48"/><char style="wj">zeṛe, </char></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 9:48">
    <char style="wj">"'log okkole hitarare hár, hin no morer,</char></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 9:48">
    <char style="wj">ar oin o no nifer.'</char><verse eid="MRK 9:48"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="MRK 9:49"/>
    <char style="wj">Kiyollahoile fotti manušore oin di forikka gora oibo, zendilla kurbanire nun di pak saf gore. </char><verse eid="MRK 9:49"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="MRK 9:50"/>
    <char style="wj">"Nun bala ziniš, kintu nunottu zodi nunor moza zagoi, toile hin ken gori abar nun oi faribo? Tũwarar dilot nun rako edde tũwara ekzone ar ekzon loi šantit tako."</char><verse eid="MRK 9:50"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 9"/>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="MRK 10"/>
  <para style="s">Biya gora edde bou sárar babute šikka</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 19:1-9">Moti 19:1–9</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 10:1"/>Bade Isa hentu uiṭṭe edde Ehudiya Elehat edde Zordanor dusora farot giye. Abar hibar hãse manuš okkole ai zoma oiye, ar hibaye hibar niyom mozin hitarare šikka diye.<verse eid="MRK 10:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 10:2"/>He šomot hoekzon Foroši aišše edde hibare forikka gori saibolla fusar goijje, "Ekzon manuše hitar nizor bouwore sarifela iyan ki ain mozin?"<verse eid="MRK 10:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 10:3"/>Isaye hitarare hodde,<char style="wj">"Musaye tũwarare ki hokum diye?"</char><verse eid="MRK 10:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 10:4"/>Hitara hodde, "Ekzon manuše hitar nizor bouwore sarhabos diyore dũrai dibar ejazot Musaye diye."<verse eid="MRK 10:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 10:5"/>Toi hibaye hitarare hodde,<char style="wj">"Tũwarar dil koṭin boli Musaye tũwaralla ei ain leikke,</char> <verse eid="MRK 10:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 10:6"/><char style="wj">Kintu sirištir šuruttu loti Allaye 'hitarare maya edde morod gori sirišti goijje.'</char> <verse eid="MRK 10:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 10:7"/><char style="wj">'Hetolla manuše hitar bab mare erizaibo edde hitar bou loi ek oibo, ar hitara duizon ek ga oibo,</char> <verse eid="MRK 10:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 10:8"/><char style="wj">ar hitara duizon ek ga oibo;' hetolla hitara ar dui nai, kintu ek ga.</char> <verse eid="MRK 10:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 10:9"/><char style="wj">Hetolla ziyan Allaye ekku fũwati zug goijje, manuše hiyanore aleda no gorok."</char><verse eid="MRK 10:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 10:10"/>Toi góror butore hibar sahabi okkole ei ekkui befare Isare abar suwal goijje. <verse eid="MRK 10:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 10:11"/>Hibaye hodde, <char style="wj">"Ze honokiye nizor bouwore sari diyore ar ekzonore biya gore hite hitar bouwor berudde zena gore.</char> <verse eid="MRK 10:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 10:12"/><char style="wj">Ar zodi ekzon mayafuwaye hibar nizor zamaire sari diyore ar ekzon loi biya gore, toile hibaye o zena gore.</char>"<verse eid="MRK 10:12"/></para>
  <para style="s">Isa edde gura fuwain</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 19:13-15">Moti 19:13–15</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:15-17">Luk 18:15–17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 10:13"/>Hitara gura fuwain okkolore o Isar hãse ainne, toi zene hibaye hitarare sui fare, kintu sahabi okkole hitarare gozgozaiye. <verse eid="MRK 10:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 10:14"/>Isaye hen dekiyore hiba beši naraz oiye edde hitarare hodde,<char style="wj">"Gura fuwaindore ãr hãse aito do, ar hitarare banda no diyo, kiyollahoile Allar raijjo itarar ḍoilla mainšor.</char> <verse eid="MRK 10:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 10:15"/><char style="wj">Ãi tũwarare soiyi hoir, ze honokiye ugguwa gura fuwar ḍoilla oi Allar raijjo no gose, hite hono mote heṛe goli no faribo."</char><verse eid="MRK 10:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 10:16"/>Tarfore Isaye he gura fuwaindore hate ãza mari loiye, edde hibar hat rakiyore hitarare duwa goijje.<verse eid="MRK 10:16"/></para>
  <para style="s">Isa edde he tuwangor manušwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 19:16-30">Moti 19:16–30</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 1:18-30">Luk 1:18–30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 10:17"/>Isaye abar za šuru goijje, hetunot ekzon manuš dũri hibar hãse aišše edde hibar sarme ãṛu felaiyore hodde, "Oh bala ustad, akeri zibon faibolla ãttu bala ham ki gora foribo?"<verse eid="MRK 10:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 10:18"/>Kintu Isaye hitare hodde,<char style="wj">"Ãre kiyolla bala hor? Allah ekzon sara ar honokiye bala no.</char> <verse eid="MRK 10:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 10:19"/><char style="wj">Tũi to hokumgun zano: 'Kun no goijjo, zena no goijjo, suri no goijjo, misa goba no diyo, honokiyore no ṭokaito, tũwar baf mare šorman goro.'"</char><verse eid="MRK 10:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 10:20"/>Hite hodde: "Ustad! Gura halottu loti ãi in okkol falon gori aiyir."<verse eid="MRK 10:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 10:21"/>Isattu hitare ador laigge edde hitar mikka saiyore hodde, <char style="wj">"Ehon o tũwattu ekkan ham baki ase, zo, tũwattu za kissu ase hin beggun besifelogoi, ar hin gorib okkolore baṛidogoi, henot tũi behostot dón faiba, tarfore aiyore ãr fisa lo."</char><verse eid="MRK 10:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 10:22"/>Kintu ei zuwabor zoriya hitar nakmuk hala oigiyegoi edde ferešan oiyore giyegoi, kiyollahoile hitattu beši šombotti aššil.<verse eid="MRK 10:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 10:23"/>Ar Isaye sairo mikka saiye edde sahabi okkolore hodde, <char style="wj">"Tuwangor okkololla Allar raijjot gola hondilla koṭin oibo!"</char><verse eid="MRK 10:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 10:24"/>Sahabi okkole hibar hota funiyore ammuwak oiye. Isaye abar hodde, <char style="wj">"Fuwain okkol, hitaralla Allar raijjot gola iyan hondilla koṭin!</char> <verse eid="MRK 10:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 10:25"/><char style="wj">Tuwangor okkol Allar raijjot golattuwaro fũišor fai bai uṭ gola aro asan."</char><verse eid="MRK 10:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 10:26"/>Henot hitara aro beši ammuwak oiye edde hitara ekzonore ekzone hodde, "Toile uddar hone oi faribo?"<verse eid="MRK 10:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 10:27"/>Isaye hitarar hikka saiye edde hodde, <char style="wj">"Mainšolla iyan ošombob, kintu Allalla hár kissu šombob."</char><verse eid="MRK 10:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 10:28"/>Toi Fitore endilla howa šuru goijje, "Ãralla ken oibo? So, ãra hár kissu felai aišši edde õnor fisa loiyi!"<verse eid="MRK 10:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 10:29"/>Zuwabe Isaye hodde, <char style="wj">"Ãi tũwarare soiyi hoir, ze hono ekzone ãr namolla edde kušir hoborolla buli gór, bái boin, ma baf, futziyain ba zaga zobin eri difelaiye,</char> <verse eid="MRK 10:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 10:30"/><char style="wj">hitara ekšot gun beši faibo, ar akéri zibon o faibo. Ei zugot o gór, bái, boin, ma, fuwain edde zaga zobin faibo, kintu fũwati ottisar o bug gora foribo edde aiyedde zugot akéri zibon faibo.</char> <verse eid="MRK 10:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 10:31"/><char style="wj">Kintu funo! Hitarar foilar hataror bout kiye šešor hatarot oibo ar šešor hataror hitara foilar hataror oibo."</char><verse eid="MRK 10:31"/></para>
  <para style="s">Isaye tisera bar hibar moron edde uwafes zindar babute hor</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 20:17-19">Moti 20:17–19</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:31-34">Luk 18:31–34</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 10:32"/>Hitara uwore Zeruzalem zadde fõtot, Isa hitarar age age ãṭṭil. Sahabi okkol ammuwak oiye edde zara hibar fise fise giye, hitara ḍoraiye. Abar hibaye he barozonore ek ḍaikka loigiye edde hiba nizor uwore zin goṭibo he babute howa šuru goijje. <verse eid="MRK 10:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 10:33"/>Hibaye hodde, <char style="wj">"So, ãra Zeruzalem zair. Heṛe Adomor Futore ḍõr imam edde alem okkolor hatot tuli diya oibo. Hitara hibar bisar gori hibare moron šaza faibar laikka ṭoraibo, edde Oihudi okkolor hatot tuli dibo,</char> <verse eid="MRK 10:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 10:34"/><char style="wj">hitara hibare loi ṭaṭṭa goribo edde hibare sep maribo, souk maribo edde marifelaibo. Bade tin dinor din hiba zinda uṛi zaiboi."</char><verse eid="MRK 10:34"/></para>
  <para style="s">Šašon no goijjo, kintu šeba goroya o</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 20:20-28">Moti 20:20–28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 10:35"/>Bade Sebdeusor fuwain Yakub edde Yuhannaye Isar hãse aiyore hodde, "Ustad, ãra ziyan sai hiyan õne ãralla goro."<verse eid="MRK 10:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 10:36"/>Isaye hodde,<char style="wj">"Tũwara ki so? Ãi tũwaralla ki goritam?"</char><verse eid="MRK 10:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 10:37"/>Hitara hodde, "Õne zẽtte kuduruti loi razagiri goriba hẽtte ãra ekzonore õnor den ḍakottu edde ar ekzonore ban ḍakottu boito do."<verse eid="MRK 10:37"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 10:38"/>Isaye hodde, <char style="wj">"Tũwara kiyor babute sor hin tũwara no zano. Ze motor fiyala ãi fito zair hin ki tũwara fi fariba? Otóba ze torikotor gusol ãre gora or tũwara ki he gusol loi fariba?"</char><verse eid="MRK 10:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 10:39"/>Hitara zuwabe hodde, "Ãra faijjum"</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 10:39">Isaye hitarare hodde,<char style="wj">"Ze motor fiyala ãi fiyum tũwara fiba, ar ze torikotor gusol ãre diya oiye he gusol tũwarare o diya oibo,</char> <verse eid="MRK 10:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 10:40"/><char style="wj">kintu ãr ḍen ḍakottu otóba ban ḍakottu boito dibolla ãttu odihar nai. Ei zaga okkol in zaralla ṭik gori raka oiye, hitara hin faibo."</char><verse eid="MRK 10:40"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 10:41"/>Baki došzone ei babute funiyore Yakub edde Yuhannar uwore gušša oiye. <verse eid="MRK 10:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 10:42"/>Hetunot Isaye beggunore ekkui fũwati ḍakiyore hodde, <char style="wj">"Tũwara zano ze, zara Oihudi okkolor šašon goroya hitara hitarar uwore kemota sola, ar hitarar ḍõr manuš okkole hitarar uwore kemota sola,</char> <verse eid="MRK 10:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 10:43"/><char style="wj">Kintu tũwarar butore hendilla no on sa, bolke tũwarar butore honokiye zodi ḍõr oito sa, hite tũwarar šeba goroya ok.</char> <verse eid="MRK 10:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 10:44"/><char style="wj">Ar ze tũwarar butore foila oito sa, hitattu beggunor gulam owa foribo,</char> <verse eid="MRK 10:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 10:45"/><char style="wj">kiyollahoile Adomor Fut udda šeba faibolla nu aiye, bolke šeba goitto aišše edde bout mainšor azadir dam hisabe hibar foran dibolla aišše."</char><verse eid="MRK 10:45"/></para>
  <para style="s">Anda Bartimeus</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 20:29-34">Moti 20:29–34</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:35-43">Luk 18:35–43</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 10:46"/>Bade hitara Zeriku šohorot giye. Isa edde hibar sahabi okkole ek ḍõr dolor fũwati šohorottu niyoli zargoide šomot ekzon anda manuš fõtor ḍake horat magedde boiṛa aššil. Hitar nam aššilde Bartimeus, Timeusor fuwa. <verse eid="MRK 10:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 10:47"/>Zehon hite fuinne ze hiba Nasarator Isa, hite guzora šuru goijje, "Daudor bongšor Isa, ãre doya goro."<verse eid="MRK 10:47"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="MRK 10:48"/>Boute hitare dõk diye edde nizam taito hoiye, kintu hite aro beši guzora šuru goijje, "Daudor bongšor Isa, ãre doya goro!"<verse eid="MRK 10:48"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="MRK 10:49"/>Isaye tamiyore hodde, <char style="wj">"Hitare eṛe aito ho!"</char></para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 10:49">Mainše he andaware ḍaikke edde hodde, "Himmot gor, uṭ! Hibaye tore ḍaker." <verse eid="MRK 10:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MRK 10:50"/>Hetunot hite hitar saddorgan ek ḍaikka felai rakiyore falmari uiṭṭe edde Isar hãse aišše.<verse eid="MRK 10:50"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="MRK 10:51"/>Isaye fusar goijje,<char style="wj">"Ãi tolla ki goriyum, tui ki sos?"</char></para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 10:51">He anda manušwaye hodde, "Malik, ãi suke deki farifan gori do."<verse eid="MRK 10:51"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="MRK 10:52"/>Toi Isaye hodde, <char style="wj">"Dór, za! Tor biššaše tore aram goijje."</char></para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 10:52">Henot hite hehon deki faijje edde fõtot hite Isar fisa loiye.<verse eid="MRK 10:52"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 10"/>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="MRK 11"/>
  <para style="s">Isa Zeruzalem goler</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:1-11">Moti 21:1–11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 19:28-38">Luk 19:28–38</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 12:12-16">Yuhunna 12:12–16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 11:1"/>Hitara zẽtte Zeruzalemor hãsa hãsi oiye edde Zaitun faharor ḍake Betfage edde Betaniya farar hãse aišše, Isaye duizon sahabire <verse eid="MRK 11:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 11:2"/>endilla hoi defeṛaiye,<char style="wj">"Oi sarmor farat zo, heṛe goli mottor ek gadar so banda dekiba, zibar uwore ehon o hono manuše no boiye. Hiba kuli ãlla loi anogoi.</char> <verse eid="MRK 11:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 11:3"/><char style="wj">Ar zodi honokiye fusar gore, 'Tũwara hendilla kiyolla goror?' toile hoiba, 'Ibare Malikottu dorhar oiye edde ibare uwafes toratori eṛe firai dibo.'"</char><verse eid="MRK 11:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 11:4"/>Toi hitara giye edde gadar soware rastat ekkan dorozar ḍake banda faiye. Hitara hibare kuille. <verse eid="MRK 11:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 11:5"/>Henot heṛe zara tiyai aššilde hitara hodde, "Tũwara ki goror? Gadar sowa kiyolla kulor?"<verse eid="MRK 11:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 11:6"/>Isaye zendilla hoito hoil hitara hendilla hoiye, toi hitarare ejazot diye. <verse eid="MRK 11:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 11:7"/>Tarfore hitara gadar soware Isar hãse ainne edde hibar uwore hitarar saddor bisai diye, toi hibar uwore Isa boišše. <verse eid="MRK 11:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 11:8"/>Bout mainše hibare šorman goribolla hoi hitarar saddor okkolore rastar uwore bisai diye, ar kiye maṛottu fatawala ḍeila okkol ani fõtot šiṛi diye. <verse eid="MRK 11:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 11:9"/>Ar ze manuš okkol age edde fise gil hitara guzojje,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 11:9">"Hosanna!"</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 11:9">"Malikor name ze aiyer hiba rahamoti!"<verse eid="MRK 11:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 11:10"/>"Ãrar Baf Daudor ze raijjo aiyer, hiba rahamoti."</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 11:10">"Uwore behostot Hosanna!"<verse eid="MRK 11:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 11:11"/>Bade Isa Zeruzalemot goliyore butore dórmogóror uṛanot giye. Hibaye sairo mikkar hár kissur uzu saiye, tarfore beil giyegoi boli he barozon sahabire fũwati loi Betaniyat giyegoi.<verse eid="MRK 11:11"/></para>
  <para style="s">Gula sara ḍũir gas</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:18-22">Moti 21:18–22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 11:12"/>Tarfor din, hitara Betaniya sari zargoide šomot, Isattu bug laigge. <verse eid="MRK 11:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 11:13"/>Hibaye durottu ugguwa fatawala ḍũir gas deikke edde hibat hono gula asene nai saito giye. Kintu hiba heṛe zaiyore fata bade ar kissu no fa, kiyollahoile hẽtte ḍũir gula dorede ainda no. <verse eid="MRK 11:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 11:14"/>Toi hibaye gassware hodde,<char style="wj">"Ar hono din honokiye tottu gula no háibo."</char> Ar ei hota hibaye hodde hibar sahabi okkole fuinne.<verse eid="MRK 11:14"/></para>
  <para style="s">Dórmogór munazator zaga</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:12-17">Moti 21:12–17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 19:45-48">Luk 19:45–48</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 2:13-16">Yuhunna 2:13–16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 11:15"/>Bade hitara Zeruzalem aišše, ar Isa uwore dórmogóror uṛanot góille edde heṛe zara besa kina goijjil hitarare hentu lorai diya šuru goijje. Hibaye ṭiya bodolidoya okkolor ṭebil edde hoitor besoya okkolor ṭebil uldai diye. <verse eid="MRK 11:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 11:16"/>Ar hibaye dórmogóror uṛan bai honokiyore hono besa kinar ziniš boi loizaito no de. <verse eid="MRK 11:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 11:17"/>Bade hibaye šikka diye, <char style="wj">"Iyan endilla leka nai ne?, 'Ãr górore hár zatilla munazator gór ḍaka oibo'? Kintu tũwara iyanore ḍahaitor aḍḍahana banaifelaiyo!"</char><verse eid="MRK 11:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 11:18"/>Ḍõr imam edde alem okkole ei hota fuinne edde hitara hibare marifelaibolla rasta tuwa šuru goijje. Hitara hibare ḍoraito, kiyollahoile manuš okkol hibar šikkat tajjuf oi zaitogoi.<verse eid="MRK 11:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 11:19"/>Ar hazinna oile Isa edde hibar sahabi okkol šohoror baire zaitogoi.<verse eid="MRK 11:19"/></para>
  <para style="s">Biššaš edde duwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:18-22">Moti 21:18–22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 11:20"/>Toi hitara binna zadde ṭaimot dekedde ḍũir gasswa šiyorottu loti fuwai giyegoi. <verse eid="MRK 11:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 11:21"/>Fitorottu Isar hota monot foijje edde hodde, "Ustad, so, ze ḍũir gasore õne bodduwa dila hiba fuwai giyegoi."<verse eid="MRK 11:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 11:22"/>Hetunot Isaye hitarare zuwabe hodde,<char style="wj">"Allar uwore biššaš rako!</char> <verse eid="MRK 11:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 11:23"/><char style="wj">Ãi tũwarare soiyi hoir, zodi honokiye ei faharore ho, 'Uṛiyore doriyat zai for,' ar hitar dile šondo no gore kintu hite ziyan hoiye hiyan oibode biššaš gore, iyan hitalla gora oibo.</char> <verse eid="MRK 11:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 11:24"/><char style="wj">Hetolla ãi tũwarare hoir, tũwarar munazatot ze hono kissu so, biššaš goro ze tũwara hin faifelaiyo, ar hin tũwarar oibo.</char> <verse eid="MRK 11:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 11:25"/><char style="wj">Ar tũwara zẽtte munazat goitto tiyo, honokiyor berudde hono kissu take, toile hitare maf goro, zene tũwarar behostor Bafe o tũwarar guna maf gori fare."</char> <verse eid="MRK 11:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 11:26"/><char style="wj">(Kintu tũwara zodi maf no goro, toile tũwarare o tũwarar behostor Bafe tũwarar guna maf no goribo.)</char><verse eid="MRK 11:26"/></para>
  <para style="s">Isar kemotar babute suwal</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:23-27">Moti 21:23–27</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:1-8">Luk 20:1–8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 11:27"/>Hitara abar Zeruzalemot aišše edde dórmogóror uṛanot Isaye gura fira gorer, ḍõr imam okkol, he alem okkol edde bura murobbi okkol hibar hãse aišše, <verse eid="MRK 11:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 11:28"/>edde hitara hibare hodde, "Har kemota loi tui in okkol goros? Otóba in goribolla ei kemota tore hone diye?"<verse eid="MRK 11:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 11:29"/>Toi zuwabe Isaye hitarare hodde,<char style="wj">"Ãi o tũwarare ekkan hota suwal gori, ãre hiyanor zuwab do, toi ãi o tũwarare hoiyum har kemota loi ãi in okkol gori.</char> <verse eid="MRK 11:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 11:30"/><char style="wj">Yahyar torikotor gusol, iyan ki Allattu naki mainšottu?" </char><verse eid="MRK 11:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 11:31"/>Toi hitara ekzone ekzon loi mošora gori hodde, "Zodi hoi, 'Allaro torfottu,' hen oile hite hoibo, 'Toile tũwara Yahyare biššaš ka no goro?' <verse eid="MRK 11:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 11:32"/>Naki endilla zuwab diyum, 'Mainšor torfottu?'" (Kintu hitara mainšore ḍoraiye, kiyollahoile beggune Yahyare ekzon soiyi nobi boli mainto.)<verse eid="MRK 11:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 11:33"/>Toi hitara Isare zuwab diye, "Ãra no zani."</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 11:33">Hetunot Isaye hodde, <char style="wj">"Toile ãi o tũwarare no hoiyum har kemota loi ãi in okkol gori."</char><verse eid="MRK 11:33"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 11"/>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="MRK 12"/>
  <para style="s">Ãngur saša okkol edde mirazdar</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:33-46">Moti 21:33–46</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:9-19">Luk 20:9–19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 12:1"/>Toi Isaye hitarare mesal kahani loi hota howa šuru goijje: <char style="wj">"Ekzon manuše ekkan ãngur keti goijje, ar hiyanor sairo ḍakottu gíra diyore butore šoraf banaibolla ugguwa gãt tiyar goijje, edde ekkan usol fahara gór bainde. Bade hite hoekzon sašar hãse hiyan lagaiyore bidešot giyegoi.</char> <verse eid="MRK 12:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 12:2"/><char style="wj">Gular ainda zẽtte aišše, hite hitar gular bag loianibolla ekzon gulamore oi saša okkolor hãse defeṛaiye.</char> <verse eid="MRK 12:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 12:3"/><char style="wj">Kintu hitara he gulamware doriyore maijje edde hali hate dũrai diye.</char> <verse eid="MRK 12:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 12:4"/><char style="wj">Tafore hite ar ekzon gulamore hitarar hãse defeṛaiye. Hitara hitare o mata sai mari agat goijje edde ofoman goijje.</char> <verse eid="MRK 12:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 12:5"/><char style="wj">Hite tarfore o aro ekzonore defeṛaiye. Hitara hitare mari felaiye. Tarfore hite aro bout zonore defeṛaiye, kintu hitarar butottu hoekzonore mara dora goijje, ar hoekzonore marifelaiye.</char><verse eid="MRK 12:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 12:6"/>
    <char style="wj">"Heṛe defeṛaibolla hitattu basi aššilde šude ekzon, hiba oilde hitar nizor adoijja fut. 'Hitara ãr futore oile ijjot goribo' hen bafiyore šešottu hitare hitarar hãse defeṛaiye.</char><verse eid="MRK 12:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 12:7"/>
    <char style="wj">"Kintu saša okkole ekzonore ekzone hodde, 'Ite mirazdar, aiyo, ãra itare marifelai, toi miraz ãrar oi zaiboi'.</char> <verse eid="MRK 12:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 12:8"/><char style="wj">Hitara hitare dori marifelaiye. Tarfore ãngur ketir baire felai diye.</char><verse eid="MRK 12:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 12:9"/>
    <char style="wj">"Toile ãngur ketir girose ki goribo, hosai? Hite aibo edde he saša okkolore marifelaibo ar ketigan o oinno kiyore difelaibo.</char> <verse eid="MRK 12:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 12:10"/><char style="wj">Tũwara kitabor ei lekagun no foro ne:</char></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 12:10">
    <char style="wj">"'Ze fattorguware raz mistiri okkole batil goijje:</char></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 12:10">
    <char style="wj">hiba i beši dorhari fattor oi uiṭṭe.</char><verse eid="MRK 12:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 12:11"/>
    <char style="wj">Iyan Mabud nizor ham,</char></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 12:11">
    <char style="wj">ar hiyan ãrar sukot kub beši tajjuiffa.'"</char><verse eid="MRK 12:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 12:12"/>Hetunot he dormiyo neta okkole Isare dorifelaibolla kušiš goijje, kiyollahoile hitara buzifaijjil ze Isaye mesal kahanigan hitarar berudde hoiye. Kintu hitara mainšore ḍoraiye, hetolla hitara zar zar bote te te giyegoi.<verse eid="MRK 12:12"/></para>
  <para style="s">Hazna diyar babute suwal</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 22:15-22">Moti 22:15–22</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:20-26">Luk 20:20–26</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 12:13"/>Tarfore hitara Isar hotat doribolla hoekzon Foroši edde Herudiyo okkolore Isar hãse defeṛaiye. <verse eid="MRK 12:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 12:14"/>Toi hitara Isar hãse aišše edde hodde, "Ustad, ãra zani õne hamiša soiyir uzu tako, ar mainše ki mone goribo hin õne forba no goro, kiyollahoile õne honokiyor suk saiya muk saiya kissu no goro, kintu Allar rastar babute ziyan soiyi hiyan šikka do.Toile Romor badšare hazna diya iyan ṭik ne naki beṭik? Ãra diyum ne naki no diyum?"<verse eid="MRK 12:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 12:15"/>Kintu Isaye hitarar bonḍami sail buzi fariyore hitarare hodde,<char style="wj">"Tũwara ãre fãndot feilaito kiyolla sešta goror? Ãlla ekkan foiša ano edde ãi hiyan ekka sai!"</char> <verse eid="MRK 12:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 12:16"/>Hitara ekkan foiša anidiye. Bade Isaye fusar goredde, <char style="wj">"Iyanor uwore har sóbi edde nam ase?"</char></para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 12:16">Toi hitara hodde, "Romor badšar"<verse eid="MRK 12:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 12:17"/>Toi hibaye hitarare hodde, <char style="wj">"Toile zin zin Romor badšar hin Romor badšare do, ar zin zin Allar hin Allare do!" </char></para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 12:17">Ei hotar uwore hitara ammuwak oiye.<verse eid="MRK 12:17"/></para>
  <para style="s">Mora okkol uwafes zinda</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 22:23-33">Moti 22:23–33</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:27-38">Luk 20:27–38</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 12:18"/>Tarfore Sadduki okkol Isar hãse aišše, zara hoito heṛe hono uwafes zinda nai, toi hitara Isar hãse suwal goijje. <verse eid="MRK 12:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 12:19"/>"Ustad, nobi Musaye ãralla leki giye, hono ekzonor bái zodi fuwain no owaite bouwore raki mori zagoi, toile hitar báiye he bouwore biya goribo, edde nizor báiyolla bongšo baraibo. <verse eid="MRK 12:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 12:20"/>Ehon, hãt bái ase ek górot. Foilawaye biya goijje, kintu hono fuwain no raka abostat mori giyegoi. <verse eid="MRK 12:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 12:21"/>Bade hibare dusorawaye biya goijje, kintu hite o hono fuwain no raka abostat mori giyegoi. Ar hendilla ekkui bafe tiserawaye goijje. <verse eid="MRK 12:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 12:22"/>Hitara hãtozon honokiyottu fũwain no o. Šeše he mayafuwawa o morigiyegoi. <verse eid="MRK 12:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 12:23"/>Henoile uwafes zindar šomot, hitara zẽtte uwafes zinda oibo, hitarar butottu hiba har bou oibo? Hibarede hãtozon beggune biya goijjil."<verse eid="MRK 12:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 12:24"/>Isaye hitarare zuwab diye, <char style="wj">"Tũwara búl, kiyollahoile tũwara no buzo Allar kalam otóba no buzo Allar šoktire.</char> <verse eid="MRK 12:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 12:25"/><char style="wj">Mora okkol zẽtte zinda oi uṛibo, hitara biya no goribo ar biya o diya no oibo, hitara behostot firista okkolor ḍoilla.</char> <verse eid="MRK 12:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 12:26"/><char style="wj">Kintu mora okkol uwafes uṛar babute tũwara zolonto zúwãr kahani Torah šorifot no foro ne? Allaye Musare hodde, 'Ãi Ibrahimor Allah, Isakor Allah, edde Yakubor Allah.'</char> <verse eid="MRK 12:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 12:27"/><char style="wj">Hiba mora okkolor Allah no, kintu zinda okkolor. Tũwara beši ḍõr búl fõtot aso!"</char><verse eid="MRK 12:27"/></para>
  <para style="s">Foila hokumgan</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 22:34-40">Moti 22:34–40</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 10:25-28">Luk 10:25–28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 12:28"/>Hitarar ekzon aleme heṛe aiyore hitarar barabari fuinne edde Isaye hondilla bala zuwab diyede hiyan buzi fariyore Isar hãse giye edde fusar goijje, "Hokum beggunor butore honnan beši zoruri?"<verse eid="MRK 12:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 12:29"/>Isaye hodde, <char style="wj">"Beši zoruri oilde iyan, 'Funo Israili okkol! Ãrar Mabud Allah, Mabud oilde ek.</char> <verse eid="MRK 12:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 12:30"/><char style="wj">Tũi tũwar hár dil, hár mon hár foran, hár šokti, diyore Allah Mabudore muhabbot goro.'</char> <verse eid="MRK 12:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 12:31"/><char style="wj">Ar dusoragan oilde iyan: 'Ar tũwar ḍen gór bam gójjare nizor zani muhabbot goro.' Inottuwaro ar hono ḍõr hokum nai."</char><verse eid="MRK 12:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 12:32"/>He aleme hibare hodde, "Ustad, bala hoiyo. Õne soiyi hoiyo ze Mabud oilde ek, Hiba sara ar oinno honokiye nai. <verse eid="MRK 12:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 12:33"/>Ar hár dil, hár buddi edde hár šokti diyore hibare muhabbot gora edde ḍen gór bam gójjare nizor zani muhabbot gora oilde aro beši muilloban, hár fura-kurbani okkol edde kurbani okkolottuwaro."<verse eid="MRK 12:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 12:34"/>He aleme hondilla giyani zuwab diye hiyan Isaye dekiyore, hibaye hitare hodde, <char style="wj">"Tui Allar raijjottu beši dure no."</char> He oite honokiye ar hono suwal goitte himmot no gore.<verse eid="MRK 12:34"/></para>
  <para style="s">Mosi honnuwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 22:41-46">Moti 22:41–46</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:41-44">Luk 20:41–44</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 12:35"/>Isaye dórmogóror uṛanot šikka dedde šomot, hibaye hodde, <char style="wj">"He alem okkole ken gori Mosire Daudor fuwa hoi fare?</char> <verse eid="MRK 12:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 12:36"/><char style="wj">Daud nize, Pak Ruhur duwara elan goijje:</char></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 12:36">
    <char style="wj">"'Mabude ãr Malikore hodde:</char></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 12:36">
    <char style="wj">"Ãr ḍen ḍakottu boi,</char></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 12:36">
    <char style="wj">zetodin ãi tor dušmon okkolore</char></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 12:36">
    <char style="wj">tor ṭengor tole no raki."' </char><verse eid="MRK 12:36"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 12:37"/>
    <char style="wj">Daude nize hibare Malik ḍaker, toile hiba ken gori Daudor fuwa oi faribo?"</char></para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 12:37">Ek ḍor mainšor dole kušir sãte hibar hota fuinne.<verse eid="MRK 12:37"/></para>
  <para style="s">Alem okkolor berudde hũšiyari</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 23:1-36">Moti 23:1–36</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:45-47">Luk 20:45–47</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 12:38"/>Ar šikka dedde šomot hibaye hodde,<char style="wj">"Alem okkolottu hũšiyar! Hitara lamba lamba hor findi beraito sa edde haṛot bazarot mainšor solam,</char> <verse eid="MRK 12:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 12:39"/><char style="wj">muzolišhanar usol zagat edde mela šobar barik zagat buware foson gore.</char> <verse eid="MRK 12:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 12:40"/><char style="wj">Hitara rari okkolor gór okkol dokol gore, ar mainšore dehaibolla lamba gori duwa gore. Hendilla mainše bisaror din bout beši šasti faibo."</char><verse eid="MRK 12:40"/></para>
  <para style="s">Gorib rarir dan</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 21:1-4">Luk 21:1–4</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 12:41"/>Toi Isaye dórmogóror dan bakšur ḍake sarmottu boiyore, mainše hitarar nizor nizor ṭiyare dan bakšut rakedde saiye. Bout tuwangor okkole beši diye. <verse eid="MRK 12:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 12:42"/>Kintu ekzon gorib rari maya fuwa o aišše edde duiyan šoṛo tamar foiša raikke, zinor muillo šude ho ek fiya. <verse eid="MRK 12:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 12:43"/>Toi Isaye sahabi okkolore hibar hãse ḍaikke edde hodde, <char style="wj">"Ãi tũwarare soiyi hoir, oinno zara ei dórmogóror dan bakšut raikke, hitara beggunottuwaro ei gorib rari mayafuwawaye beši raikke.</char> <verse eid="MRK 12:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 12:44"/><char style="wj">Kiyollahoile hitara beggune hitarar beši šombottittu dan bakšut raikke, kintu hibaye hiba obafi oi bade o, hibattu foran basaibolla zin aššil, hin beggun di felaiye."</char><verse eid="MRK 12:44"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 12"/>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="MRK 13"/>
  <para style="s">Šeš halor sinno okkol edde dórmogór dongšo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:1-2">Moti 24:1–2</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:5-6">Luk 21:5–6</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 13:1"/>Toi Isa dórmogórottu niyoli zargoide šomot hibar sahabi okkolor ekzone hibare hodde, "Ustad, so, ken šundor šundor fattor okkol edde kuṭa okkol!"<verse eid="MRK 13:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 13:2"/>Isaye hitare zuwabe hodde,<char style="wj">"Oi, tui ei ḍõr kuṭa okkol banaiyede dehor ne? Inor ekkan fattor o ar ekkan fattoror uwore no takibo, beggun bangi fela oibo."</char><verse eid="MRK 13:2"/></para>
  <para style="s">Zulumor šuru</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:3-14">Moti 24:3–14</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:7-19">Luk 21:7–19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 13:3"/>Toi Isaye dórmogóror uṛanor muntu Zaitun faharor uwore boišše ar Fitor, Yakub, Yuhanna edde Andreas hibar fũwati ekela aššil, hitara hibare fusar goredde, <verse eid="MRK 13:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 13:4"/>"Õne ãrare ho, in okkol hõtte oibo edde in okkol beggun furon oibode hiyar sinno ki?"<verse eid="MRK 13:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 13:5"/>Toi Isaye hitarare zuwabe howa šuru goijje: <char style="wj">"Saiyo, hono honokiye tũwarare dúhat felar ne!</char> <verse eid="MRK 13:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 13:6"/><char style="wj">Kiyollahoile boute ãr namor béddori aibo, ar hoibo, 'Ãi hiba,' edde boutore búl fõtot loizaibo.</char> <verse eid="MRK 13:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 13:7"/><char style="wj">Ar zẽtte tũwara larair babute funor edde larair andeikka hóborahóbor funiba, hẽtte no ḍoraiyo! In okkol hameka goṭa foribo, kintu hetunot o šeš no.</char> <verse eid="MRK 13:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 13:8"/><char style="wj">Ek zatiye oinno zatir berudde edde ek raijjoye oinno raijjor berudde larai goribo. Ar bout zagat raṭ edde busal oibo. Kintu in okkol šude fuwa biyaibar šomot zontoronar šuru.</char><verse eid="MRK 13:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 13:9"/>
    <char style="wj">"Tũwara hũšiyar taikko! Hitara tũwarare bisar šobar hatot tuli dibo, hitara tũwarare sinagogot bet maribo, ar ãlla boli tũwarattu šašon goroya edde raza okkolor muntu tiya foribo. Hitarar hãse ãr babute goba diba.</char> <verse eid="MRK 13:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 13:10"/><char style="wj">Edde hár zatir hãse foila kušir hóbor tobolig gora foribo.</char> <verse eid="MRK 13:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 13:11"/><char style="wj">Kintu hitara zẽtte tũwarare doribo edde bisarot loizaibo, hetunot ki hoiba he babute age loti sinta no goijjo, kintu he šomot ze hota tũwarare howa oibo, tũwara hin hoiba, kiyollahoile iyan endilla no ze tũwara hota hoiba bolke Pak Ruhye hota hoibo.</char><verse eid="MRK 13:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 13:12"/>
    <char style="wj">"Báiye báiyore ar bafe fuwaindore dúha diyore moutor fõtot faṭaibo, ar fuwainde baf mar berudde tiyaibo edde hitarare kun goraibo.</char> <verse eid="MRK 13:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 13:13"/><char style="wj">Ãlla boli tũwarare beggune hingša goribo, kintu ze šeš foijjonto ṭiki takibo, hite uddar faibo.</char><verse eid="MRK 13:13"/></para>
  <para style="s">He bor zulum</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:15-28">Moti 24:15–28</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:20-24">Luk 21:20–24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 13:14"/>
    <char style="wj">"Tũwara zẽtte 'šorbo naša hingšar ziniš' tiya gorai no farede zagat tiya goraiyede dekor, ze foré hite buzok! Hetunot zara Ehudiyat takibo hitara fahar okkolot dai zoggoi.</char> <verse eid="MRK 13:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 13:15"/><char style="wj">Ze góror sádor uwore ase, hite hentu góror butottu hono kissu fũwati loi zaibolla nise lami no aiyok.</char> <verse eid="MRK 13:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 13:16"/><char style="wj">Ze maṛot ase, hite gar saddor loibolla uwafes firi górot nu aiyok. </char> <verse eid="MRK 13:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 13:17"/><char style="wj">Hẽtte hamilwala mayafuwain okkol edde dudor fuwaindor ma okkololla hondilla ze oibo!</char> <verse eid="MRK 13:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 13:18"/><char style="wj">Duwa goro zene in okkol šit hale no goṭe,</char> <verse eid="MRK 13:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 13:19"/><char style="wj">kiyollahoile en beši ḍõr hošṭo oibo, zin Allaye duniyaire sirišti goijje loti ei foijjonto hono šome no o, ar sarme o no oibo.</char><verse eid="MRK 13:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 13:20"/>
    <char style="wj">"He din okkolore zodi Allaye homai no dito, toile honokiye no basito. Kintu hitara zarare hibaye basi loiye, hitarar zoriya he din okkolore hibaye homai diye.</char> <verse eid="MRK 13:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 13:21"/><char style="wj">He ṭaimot zodi honokiye tũwarare ho, 'So, Mosi eṛe!' otóba, 'So, Mosi uṛe!' tũwara biššaš no goijjo.</char> <verse eid="MRK 13:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 13:22"/><char style="wj">Kiyollahoile hẽtte bonḍo mosi okkol edde bonḍo nobi okkol muntu aibo ar keramoti edde sinnor ham goribo zene šombob oile Allar basaigora okkolore hitara dúha difare.</char><verse eid="MRK 13:22"/></para>
  <para style="s">Adomor fũwa zẽtte aibo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:29-31">Moti 24:29–31</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:25-28">Luk 21:25–28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 13:23"/>
    <char style="wj">"Tũwara hũšiyar taikko. Ãi tũwarare in okkol hár beggun age bare hoi rakilam.</char><verse eid="MRK 13:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 13:24"/>
    <char style="wj">"Kintu he din okkolot, ei mosibot farai zai bade,</char></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 13:24">
    <char style="wj">"'beil andar oi zaiboi,</char></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 13:24">
    <char style="wj">sande ar fohor no dibo.</char><verse eid="MRK 13:24"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 13:25"/>
    <char style="wj">Asmanottu tara okkol fori zaiboi,</char></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 13:25">
    <char style="wj">asmanor šokti okkolore hafai felaibo.'</char><verse eid="MRK 13:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 13:26"/>
    <char style="wj">"He šomot hitara ḍõr šokti edde mohima loi Adomor Fut miyular butottu aiyedde dekibo.</char> <verse eid="MRK 13:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 13:27"/><char style="wj">Hibaye firista okkolore defeṛaibo edde duniyair ek šimattu loti asmanor šeš šima foijjonto, sairo mikkattu hibar basai gora okkolore dola goribo.</char><verse eid="MRK 13:27"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ḍũir gasor mesal šikka</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:32-36">Moti 24:32–36</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:29-33">Luk 21:29–33</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 13:28"/>
    <char style="wj">"Ḍũir gasor mesalottu ei šikkagan šiko: Hibar ḍeila zehon hail oiyore ṭũi niyole hẽtte tũwara zani faro ze, gorom hal hãse aišše.</char> <verse eid="MRK 13:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 13:29"/><char style="wj">He bafe tũwara o zani fariba zẽtte in okkol goṭedde tũwara dekor, ze Adomor Fut hãse aigiyegoi, kub hãse, en ki, dorozat hazir.</char> <verse eid="MRK 13:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 13:30"/><char style="wj">Ãi tũwarare soiyi hoir, in beggun no goṭibar age ei halor manuš okkolor mout no oibo.</char> <verse eid="MRK 13:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 13:31"/><char style="wj">Asman zobin šeš oibo, kintu ãr hota hono din šeš no oibo.</char><verse eid="MRK 13:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 13:32"/>
    <char style="wj">"Kintu he din edde šomoiganor babute honokiye no zane, behostor firista okkole o no, Fuwaye o no, šude Bafe zanede.</char><verse eid="MRK 13:32"/></para>
  <para style="s">Tũwara seton tako</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 25:13-15">Moti 25:13–15</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 19:12-13">Luk 19:12–13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 13:33"/>
    <char style="wj">"Hetolla seton tako, kiyollahoile he din edde šoimoiganor babute tũwara no zano.</char> <verse eid="MRK 13:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 13:34"/><char style="wj">"Iyan oibode endilla, ek zon manuš bidešot musaferi goitto zar. Górottu baisa dibar age, hite hitar gulam okkolore hár hamor zimma gosai diye. Hite ekzon ekzon fotti gulamore ham diye, ar dorowanore seton takito hoiye.</char><verse eid="MRK 13:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 13:35"/>
    <char style="wj">"Hetolla seton taki fahara do, kiyollahoile góror giros hõtte aiye, ki hazinna aiye naki ada raitta aiye naki kuraye bak dedde hiya aiye, naki binna aiye tũwara hoi no faro.</char> <verse eid="MRK 13:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 13:36"/><char style="wj">Hiba atikka aiyore zene tũwarare gum zai taikkode no deke.</char> <verse eid="MRK 13:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 13:37"/><char style="wj">Ãi ziyan tũwarare hoir, hiyan ãi tũwara beggunore hoir: 'Tũwara seton tako!'"</char><verse eid="MRK 13:37"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 13"/>
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="MRK 14"/>
  <para style="s">Isare marifelaibolla felain goijje</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:1-5">Moti 26:1–5</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:1-2">Luk 22:1–2</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 11:45-53">Yuhunna 11:45-53</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 14:1"/>Uddar id edde iš adiya ruṭir id aite šude dui din baki. Ḍõr imam edde alem okkole gufone Isare dori marifelaibolla ufai tuwail. <verse eid="MRK 14:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 14:2"/>Hitara hodde, "Idor šomot no, manuš okkolor butore gulmal uṛit fare"<verse eid="MRK 14:2"/></para>
  <para style="s">Betaniyat Isare dami kušbo tel ḍali diye</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:6-13">Moti 26:6–13</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 12:1-8">Yuhunna 12:1–8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 14:3"/>Isa Betaniyar kurus biyaraimma Šimonor górot aiššil. Hitara hána hadde šomot ekzon mayafuwaye ek dóla fattoror boyomot gori kub beši dami edde asoli kušbo tel loi hibar hãse aišše. Hibaye boyommuwa bainge edde telgunore Isar matat ḍali diye.<verse eid="MRK 14:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 14:4"/>Heṛe zara hazir aššil, hitarar butottu ho ekzone naraz oiyore hodde, "Ei dami zinišgun kiyolla borbat gorifela or? <verse eid="MRK 14:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 14:5"/>Ei tel to beši dame besa zaito edde ṭiyagun loi gorib okkolore modotolla diya zaito." Ar hitara mayafuwaware hora bafe zejeṛaiye.<verse eid="MRK 14:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 14:6"/>Hetunot Isaye hodde, <char style="wj">"Tũwara hibare loi hen kiyolla goror? Hibaye ãlla ekkan bala ham goijje.</char> <verse eid="MRK 14:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 14:7"/><char style="wj">Gorib okkol to hamiša tũwarar fũwati ase, ar zẽtte mone ho tũwara hitarare modot gori fariba, kintu ãre tũwara hamiša no faiba.</char> <verse eid="MRK 14:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 14:8"/><char style="wj">Hibaye ziyan gori faitto hiyan goijje, hibaye ãr uwore ei kušbo tel ḍali diyore agottu loti ãre hoborolla tiyar goijje.</char> <verse eid="MRK 14:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 14:9"/><char style="wj">Ãi tũwarare soiyi hoir, duniyair ze hono mikka zeṛe kušir hóbor tobolig gora oibo, heṛe ei mayafuwaware monot goribolla hibar ei hamor hota o howa oibo."</char><verse eid="MRK 14:9"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ehudah Iskariyote Isare tuli dibolla razi oiye</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:14-16">Moti 26:14–16</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:3-6">Luk 22:3–6</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 14:10"/>Tarfore Ehudah Iskariyot, he baro zonor butoror ekzon, hite ḍõr imamor hãse giye edde hitarar hatot Isare tuli di faribo hoiye. <verse eid="MRK 14:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 14:11"/>Hitara hendilla funiyore beši kuši oiye edde hitare ṭĩya dibo hoi wada diye. He oite hite hibare hitarar hatot kene tulidi faribo he šuzug tuwa šuru goijje.<verse eid="MRK 14:11"/></para>
  <para style="s">Sahabi okkol loi Isar šeš hána</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:17-25">Moti 26:17–25</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:7-14">Luk 22:7–14</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 22:21-23">21–23</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 14:12"/>Iš adiya ruṭir idor foila dinot din, zẽtte rosom mozin uddar idor hánalla soolor so zorgora oito, sahabi okkole hibattu fusar goijje, "Malik, ãra hoṛe zai õnolla uddar idor hána tiyar goriyum so, zene õne uddar id falon gori faro?"<verse eid="MRK 14:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 14:13"/>Toi hibaye hibar sahabi okkolor dui zonore endilla hoi defeṛaiye, <char style="wj">"Tũwara šohoror butore zo! Heṛe ekzon manuše ek góra fani boi loi zadde lot faiba. Tũwara hitar fise fise zaiba.</char> <verse eid="MRK 14:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 14:14"/><char style="wj">Ar heṛe hite ze górot golibo, tũwara he góror girosore hoiba, 'Ustade fusar goijje, gorba gór hoṛe, zeṛe ãi ãr šahabi okkolore loi uddar idor hána hái fari?'</char> <verse eid="MRK 14:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 14:15"/><char style="wj">Henot hite tũwarare tiyar goijja dui ṭalar uwore ekkan ḍõr rum dehai dibo. Heṛe zai ãralla tiyar gorogoi."</char><verse eid="MRK 14:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 14:16"/>Toi sahabi okkole baisa diye edde šohoror butore giye. Ar Isaye zendilla hoil he mozin hin hitara faiye edde uddar idor hána tiyar goijje.<verse eid="MRK 14:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 14:17"/>Bade hazinna zehon oiye, Isaye he barozon sahabire loi heṛe aišše. <verse eid="MRK 14:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 14:18"/>Hitara hánar hádde šomot hibaye hodde,<char style="wj">"Ãi tũwarare soiyi hoir, tũwarar butottu ekzone ze ãr fũwati hána hár, hite ãre dušmonor hatot tuli dibo."</char><verse eid="MRK 14:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 14:19"/>Toi hitara ferešan oiye edde ekzon bade ekzone hibattu fusar goijje, "Hiba ki ãi?"<verse eid="MRK 14:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 14:20"/>Hibaye zuwab diye, <char style="wj">"Ze ãr fũwati hoddat ruṭi burar, hite.</char> <verse eid="MRK 14:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 14:21"/><char style="wj">Kiyollahoile Adomor Futor morar babute zendilla leka ase, hendilla oibo. Kintu afsus he manušwalla, Adomor Fut loi ze beimani gorer! Hite honodin zormo no owa iyan hitalla aro beši bala oito."</char><verse eid="MRK 14:21"/></para>
  <para style="s">Malikor hána</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:26-29">Moti 26:26–29</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:15-20">Luk 22:15–20</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 14:22"/>Hitara hána hadde šomot hibaye ruṭi loi šukuriya zanaiye edde hibaye ruṭiware bainge, toi sahabi okkolore diyore hodde,<char style="wj">"In lo, hó, in ãr ga."</char><verse eid="MRK 14:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 14:23"/>Tarfore hibaye fiyala loiyore šukuriya zanaiye, hitarare diye edde hitara beggune hibattu fi háiye.<verse eid="MRK 14:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 14:24"/>Toi Isaye hitarare hodde, <char style="wj">"In ãr lou, noya wadar suktir lou, zin beši mainšolla ḍali diya oibo.</char> <verse eid="MRK 14:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 14:25"/><char style="wj">Ãi tũwarare soiyi hoir, ãngur gasor šoraf ãi ar honodin no fiyum, zeto din Allar raijjot abar noya gori hin no fiyi."</char><verse eid="MRK 14:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 14:26"/>Tarfore hitara tarifor gan gaye, toi niyoli Zaitun faharot giye.<verse eid="MRK 14:26"/></para>
  <para style="s">Isaye Fitoror ošikaror babute hor</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:30-35">Moti 26:30–35</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:31-34">Luk 22:31–34</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 14:27"/>Isaye hitarare hodde, <char style="wj">"Tũwara beggune fori zaibagoi edde ãre eri zaibagoi," Kiyollahoile iyan endilla leka ase:</char></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 14:27">
    <char style="wj">"'Ãi sool soroyare marifelaiyum,</char></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 14:27">
    <char style="wj">ar soolgun sairo mikka šiṛašitta oi zaiboi'</char><verse eid="MRK 14:27"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 14:28"/>
    <char style="wj">Kintu ãi uṛizaigoi bade, ãi tũwarar age Galilot zaiyum."</char><verse eid="MRK 14:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 14:29"/>Hetunot Fitore hodde: "Zodi õnore beggune felai zailegoi o, ãi hen no goijjum."<verse eid="MRK 14:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 14:30"/>Isaye zuwabe hodde, <char style="wj">"Ãi tore soiyi hoir, ehon aijja raitor butore, rata kuraye dui bar bak no dite, tui ãre tin bar ošikar goribi."</char><verse eid="MRK 14:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 14:31"/>Kintu Fitore aro zur diyore hodde, "Zodi ãttu õnor fũwati mora o fore, to ãi õnore ošikar no goriyum!" He ekkui hota hitara beggune hoiye.<verse eid="MRK 14:31"/></para>
  <para style="s">Isa Mosi Getsemoni baganot</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:36-46">Moti 26:36–46</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:39-46">Luk 22:39–46</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 14:32"/>Ar hitara Getsemoni name ek zagat aišše, toi hibaye sahabi okkolore hodde, <char style="wj">"Ãi zetun duwa gori, tũwara eṛe boiyo."</char> <verse eid="MRK 14:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 14:33"/>Tarfore hibaye Fitor, Yakub edde Yuhannare fũwati loigiye edde monot kub beši zontrona edde hošto fa šuru goijje. <verse eid="MRK 14:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 14:34"/>Ar hibaye hitarare hodde, <char style="wj">"Dukke ãr foran niyoli zargoi. Tũwara eṛe tako edde seton taikko." </char><verse eid="MRK 14:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 14:35"/>Bade hiba hoddur dure zaiyore meṛit uite foijje edde munazat goijje zene šombob oile ei dukkor ṭaim hibar hãsottu dur oi zagoi. <verse eid="MRK 14:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 14:36"/>Hibaye hodde, <char style="wj">"Abba, Baf! Tũwalla hár kissu šombob. Ãttu ei motor fiyalawa loifelo. Tarfore o ãr issaye no, šude tũwar issaye gora ok."</char><verse eid="MRK 14:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 14:37"/>Tarfore hiba sahabi okkolor hãse uwafes firi aiyore hitarare gumot lot faiye. Hibaye Fitorore hodde, <char style="wj">"Simon, tui gum zodde neki? Ek gonḍa o ki seton tai no farili ne?</char> <verse eid="MRK 14:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 14:38"/><char style="wj">Seton tako ar duwa goro zene forikkat no foro! Dile issa gorer, kintu tũwarar ga durbol."</char><verse eid="MRK 14:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 14:39"/>Abar hibaye zaiyore he ekkui munazat goijje. <verse eid="MRK 14:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 14:40"/>Hiba abar firi ai hitarare gumot foijja faiye, kiyollahoile hitarar sukot gum bári aššil. Ar hitara hibare ki zuwab dibo buzi no faijjil.<verse eid="MRK 14:40"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 14:41"/>Tisera bar hiba hitarar hãse firi aišše edde hodde,<char style="wj">"Ehono tũwara gum zor edde aram goror? Beši oiye! Šomoi hãse aišše. Adomor Futore gunagaror hatot tuli diya or. </char> <verse eid="MRK 14:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 14:42"/><char style="wj">Uṛo, solo, ãra zai! Ze ãre loi beimani gorer hite hãse aigiyegoi."</char><verse eid="MRK 14:42"/></para>
  <para style="s">Isare doitto aišše</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:47-56">Moti 26:47–56</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:47-53">Luk 22:47–53</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:2-11">Yuhunna 18:2–11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 14:43"/>Ar hehon, hibaye ehon o hota hor, hen šomot Ehudah, ze barozon sahabir ekzon, hite heṛe aišše. Hitar fũwati ek ḍõr dole suri edde laṛi loi aišše. Hitarare defeṛaiyede oilde ḍõr imam okkol, alem okkol edde manuš okkolor murubbi okkole.<verse eid="MRK 14:43"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 14:44"/>Beimani goroyaye hitara loi ekkan sinno ṭik goijjil: "Ãi zare suma diyum hite oilde hiba. Tũwara hitare doriba edde fahara diyore loi zaiba." <verse eid="MRK 14:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 14:45"/>Ar hite aišše edde toratori Isar hãse zai hodde, "Rabbi" en hoi hite hibare suma diye. <verse eid="MRK 14:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 14:46"/>Toi hitara hibare doijje. <verse eid="MRK 14:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 14:47"/>Heṛe tiyai aiššilde hitarar butottu ekzone hitar suri niyolaiye edde ḍõr imamor gulamore hamela goijje edde hitar han haṛi loi felaiye.<verse eid="MRK 14:47"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="MRK 14:48"/>Isaye hitarare hodde,<char style="wj">"Ḍahait doitto zafan gori tũwara ãre kiyolla laṛi edde súri loi doitto aiššo? Ãi ki ḍahait?</char> <verse eid="MRK 14:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MRK 14:49"/><char style="wj">Fotti din ãi tũwarar fũwati aššilam edde dórmogóror uṛanot šikka diyi, kintu hẽtte to tũwara ãre no doro! Kintu kitabor hota endilla gori furon owa forer."</char> <verse eid="MRK 14:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MRK 14:50"/>Hetunot sahabi okkol beggune Isare eri dáigiyegoi.<verse eid="MRK 14:50"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="MRK 14:51"/>Ekzon zuwan fuwaye šude ekkan saddor findiyore Isar fise fise gil. Hitara hitare doijje, <verse eid="MRK 14:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="MRK 14:52"/>kintu hite he saddor felaiyore lenḍa dai giyegoi.<verse eid="MRK 14:52"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ḍõr šobar sarme Isa Mosi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:57-68">Moti 26:57–68</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:54-55">Luk 22:54–55</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 22:63-71">63–71</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:13-14">Yuhunna 18:13–14</ref>,<ref loc="JHN 18:19-24">19–24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="MRK 14:53"/>Hitara Isare ḍõr imamor hãse loigiye edde hár ḍõr imam okkol, he bura murobbi edde alem okkol beggune ekku fũwati dola oiye. <verse eid="MRK 14:53"/><verse number="54" style="v" sid="MRK 14:54"/>Kintu Fitore dure takiyore hibar fise fise zaite zaite, ḍõr imamor uṛanot foijjonto góille. Fitore heṛe faharadar okkolor fũwati oinor ṭalor ḍake boiyore oin fuhar.<verse eid="MRK 14:54"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="MRK 14:55"/>Toi ḍõr imam okkol, bura murubbi okkol edde alem okkol, mani beggune Isare marifelaibolla hibar berudde goba zuhar goitto sail, kintu hitara honokiyore no fa. <verse eid="MRK 14:55"/><verse number="56" style="v" sid="MRK 14:56"/>Hibar berudde bout kiye misa goba diye, kintu hitarar goba no mile. <verse eid="MRK 14:56"/><verse number="57" style="v" sid="MRK 14:57"/>Hetunot ho ekzone uṛi tiyaye edde hibar berudde misa goba diye, <verse eid="MRK 14:57"/><verse number="58" style="v" sid="MRK 14:58"/>"Ãra hite endilla hodde fuinni, 'Ãi ei hate banaiya dórmogór bangifelaiyum edde tin dinor butore en ar ekkan tiyar goijjum, ziyan manušor hate banaiya no.'" <verse eid="MRK 14:58"/><verse number="59" style="v" sid="MRK 14:59"/>Kintu hitarar goba o no mile.<verse eid="MRK 14:59"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v" sid="MRK 14:60"/>Hetunot ḍõr imame beggunor sarme tiyaiye edde Isare hodde, "Tor berudde hitara nališ goredde hinot tottu kissu hoibar nai neki?" <verse eid="MRK 14:60"/><verse number="61" style="v" sid="MRK 14:61"/>Kintu Isaye suf oi roiye edde hono zuwab no de.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 14:61">Ḍõr imame hibare abar fusar goijje, "Tui ki he rahamoti Allar Fut, Mosi?"<verse eid="MRK 14:61"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" sid="MRK 14:62"/>Isaye hodde, <char style="wj">"Ãi oi. Tũwara Adomor Futore he Šorbo Šoktiwalar ḍen ḍakottu boiṛade edde asmanor miyulat gori aiyedde dekiba."</char><verse eid="MRK 14:62"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="63" style="v" sid="MRK 14:63"/>Henot ḍõr imame hitar nizor hor faṛifelaiye edde hodde, "Ar ãrattu gobar ki dorhar? <verse eid="MRK 14:63"/><verse number="64" style="v" sid="MRK 14:64"/>Tũwara to kuferigan fuinno. Tũwara ki bafo?"</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 14:64">Hitara beggune hibare duši goriyore moribar laikka hoi faisala diye. <verse eid="MRK 14:64"/><verse number="65" style="v" sid="MRK 14:65"/>Toi ho ekzone hibar gat sef maijje edde hibar muk bandi guša maijje edde hodde, "Tui nobi no ne? Sai, hosai tore hone maijje!" Ar faharadar okkole loizaiyore beši mara maijje.<verse eid="MRK 14:65"/></para>
  <para style="s">Fitoror ošikar</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:69-75">Moti 26:69–75</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:56-62">Luk 22:56–62</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:15-18">Yuhunna 18:15–18</ref>,<ref loc="JHN 18:25-27">25–27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" sid="MRK 14:66"/>Fitor zẽtte lamat uṛanot aššil, hetunot ḍõr imamor ekzon bandi heṛe aišše. <verse eid="MRK 14:66"/><verse number="67" style="v" sid="MRK 14:67"/>Hibar nozor Fitore oin fuhadde hikka foijje edde hibaye bala gori Fitoror mikka saiyore hodde, "Tui o to oi Nasarator Isar fũwati aššili."<verse eid="MRK 14:67"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="68" style="v" sid="MRK 14:68"/>Kintu Fitore hiyan ošikar goijje. "Tui kiyor babute hor hin ãi no zani, no buzir," endilla hoi Fitor baror dorozar hãse giye, ar hetunot ugguwa rata kuraye bak di uiṭṭe.<verse eid="MRK 14:68"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="69" style="v" sid="MRK 14:69"/>Kintu mayafuwaye Fitorore heṛe dekiyore abar heṛe zara tiyai aššil hitarare hodde, "Ite o hitarar ekzon."<verse eid="MRK 14:69"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="70" style="v" sid="MRK 14:70"/>Kintu Fitore abar hiyan o ošikar goijje.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 14:70">Aro hotun bade, zara heṛe tiyat aššil hitara o Fitorore hodde, "Hameka tui o utarar ekzon, kiyollahoile tui o to Galilor manuš, tor baša loi buza zar."<verse eid="MRK 14:70"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="71" style="v" sid="MRK 14:71"/>Kintu Fitore nizore bodduwa diyore hosom hái hodde, "Tũwara zar babute hota hor ãi he manušware no sini."<verse eid="MRK 14:71"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="72" style="v" sid="MRK 14:72"/>Ar hehon dusora bar rata kuraye bak diye. Toi Isaye Fitorore ki hoil hiyan hibattu monot foijje: <char style="wj">"Rata kuraye dui bar bak no dite tui ãre tin bar ošikar goribi."</char> Toi hiba handa šuru goijje.<verse eid="MRK 14:72"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 14"/>
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="MRK 15"/>
  <para style="s">Filator sarme Isa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:1-2">Moti 27:1–2</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 27:11-26">11–26</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:1-5">Luk 23:1–5</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 23:13-25">13–25</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:33-40">Yuhunna 18:33–40</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:6-16">19:6–16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 15:1"/>Kub binna sore, ḍõr imam okkol edde murubbi okkol, edde alem okkol, ḍõr šobar beggune ek mošora goijje. Tarfore hitara Isare bandiyore loigiye edde Filator hatot gosaidiye.<verse eid="MRK 15:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 15:2"/>Filate fusar goredde, "Tui ki Ihudi okkolor badša?"</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 15:2">Isaye zuwabe hodde, <char style="wj">"Tũi hor hendilla"</char><verse eid="MRK 15:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 15:3"/>Ḍõr imam okkole hibar namot bout hosuri okkol diye. <verse eid="MRK 15:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 15:4"/>Tarfore Filate Isattu abar fusar goijje, "Tui ki hono zuwab no dibi? Sa, hitara tore hodun hosuri der?"<verse eid="MRK 15:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 15:5"/>Kintu Isaye ek ohor udda zuwab no de, henot Filat tajjuf oiye.<verse eid="MRK 15:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 15:6"/>Fotti uddar idot Filate mainše zare saito hendilla ekzon bondire eridito. <verse eid="MRK 15:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 15:7"/>He šomot Barabbas name ekzon manuš hokumotor ulda hórtal goroya okkolor fũwati ziyolot bondi aiššil, zara hórtalor butore ekzonore kun gorifelail. <verse eid="MRK 15:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 15:8"/>Manuš okkole Filator hãse aiyore guzora šuru goijje, hite goittode hendilla goribolla.<verse eid="MRK 15:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 15:9"/>Toi Filate hitarare hodde, "Tũwara so ne, ãi Ihudi okkolor badšare eridi?" <verse eid="MRK 15:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 15:10"/>Dõr imam okkole ze hingša gori Isare hitar hatot tulidil hiyan Filate zaintode hetolla hite hen hoiyede. <verse eid="MRK 15:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 15:11"/>Kintu ḍõr imam okkole mainšor dolore uskani diye zene Filate hitaralla Barabbasore eride.<verse eid="MRK 15:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 15:12"/>Filate abar hitarattu fusar goijje, "Toile tũwara zare Ihudi okkolor badša hoi ḍako, tũwara ki so, ãi hitare ki goittam?"<verse eid="MRK 15:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 15:13"/>Hitara guzori hodde, "Hitare kurušot do!"<verse eid="MRK 15:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 15:14"/>Filate hodde, "Kiyolla, hite ki duš goijje?"</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 15:14">Kintu hitara aro zure guzoriyore howa šuru goijje, "Hitare kurušot do!"<verse eid="MRK 15:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 15:15"/>Filate mainšor dol okkolore razi goitto saiye. Hite hitaralla Barabbasore eridiye, kintu Isare souk maraiye edde kurušot dibolla tuli difelaiye.<verse eid="MRK 15:15"/></para>
  <para style="s">Šoinno okkolor ṭaṭṭa tõša</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:27-31">Moti 27:27–31</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:2-3">Yuhunna 19:2–3</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 15:16"/>Tarfore šoinno okkole Isare loi ḍõr šašon goroyar gõrot giye edde šoinno okkol beggunore ekkui fũwati goijje. <verse eid="MRK 15:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 15:17"/>Hitara Isare baiyonna rongor hor findaiye, ar keṛa diyore ekkan taz banai matat findai diye. <verse eid="MRK 15:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 15:18"/>Tarfore hitara Isare ṭaṭṭa gori hodde, "Mórhaba, Ihudi okkolor badša!" <verse eid="MRK 15:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 15:19"/>Hitara ugguwa laṛi loi hibar mata sai bari maijje edde hibar gat sep maijje ar ãṛu felai hibare ijjot goijje. <verse eid="MRK 15:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 15:20"/>Hibare loi ṭaṭṭa gori bade hitara he baiyonna rongor hoorgan kuli loi felaiye edde hibar nizor ho sour findai diye. Toi hitara Isare kurušot dibolla niyolai loigiyegoi.<verse eid="MRK 15:20"/></para>
  <para style="s">Isare kurušot diya or</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:32-44">Moti 27:32–44</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:26-43">Luk 23:26–43</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:17-27">Yuhunna 19:17–27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 15:21"/>Ar Simon name ekzon Kuroni šohoror manuš farattu he fõt bai aiššil. Hite aššilde Alekzendar edde Rufusor baf. Šoinno okkole hitare Isar kuruš boi loi zaibolla zur goijje. <verse eid="MRK 15:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 15:22"/>Hitara hibare Golgata name ekkan zagat loigiye. Ei namor mani Mata kulir zaga. <verse eid="MRK 15:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 15:23"/>Tarfore hitara Isare tita mišaiya horor roš fito diye, kintu hibaye hin no gose. <verse eid="MRK 15:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 15:24"/>Tarfore hitara hibare kurušot diye edde hibar horgunolla har baiggot ki hor fore hiyan saibolla hitara loṭari maijje.<verse eid="MRK 15:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 15:25"/>Hitara hibare kurušot diyede hiya binna nowa baijje. <verse eid="MRK 15:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 15:26"/>Hibar berudde duš nama sainbuṛot leka aššil,</para>
  <para style="pc" vid="MRK 15:26">"IHUDI OKKOLOR BADŠA."<verse eid="MRK 15:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 15:27"/>Hibar fũwati hitara duizon ḍahaitore o kurušot diye, ekzonore ḍen ḍakottu ar oinno ekzonore bam ḍakottu. <verse eid="MRK 15:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 15:28"/>(Henot Pak kitabor ei hota furon oiye: "Hibare oinnai goroya okkolor fũwati gona oiye.") <verse eid="MRK 15:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 15:29"/>Zara he fõt bai giye hitara mata zaijje edde ofoman gori hoiye, "Tui no ne dórmogórgan bangi abar tin dinor butore hiyan tiyar gori farosde! <verse eid="MRK 15:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 15:30"/>Henoile ehon nizore basa edde kurušottu lami ai!" <verse eid="MRK 15:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 15:31"/>Hendilla ekkui bafe ḍõr imam edde alem okkole o Isare loi ṭaṭṭa goijje edde ekzonore ekzone hodde, "Hite oinno kiyore uddar goitto, kintu nizore uddar gori no farer! <verse eid="MRK 15:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 15:32"/>Ei Mosi, Israilor badša, ehon kurušottu lami ai ok, zene ãra sai fari edde biššaš gori fari." Hitara zarare hibar fũwati kurušot diye hitara o hibare ofoman goijje.<verse eid="MRK 15:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 15:33"/>Bade dũijja oiye loti tin gonḍa mula ek andar hara dešor uwore foijje. <verse eid="MRK 15:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 15:34"/>Šomoi tinnuwa baijjede šomot Isaye ḍõr abaze guzori hodde, <char style="wj">"Eloi, Eloi, lema sabaktáni?"</char> (Ziyanor mani <char style="wj">"Ãr Allah, ãr Allah, kiyolla tũi ãre felaigiyogoi?"</char>)<verse eid="MRK 15:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 15:35"/>Ḍake tiyat aššilde hitarar hoekzone ei hota funiyore hodde, "Funo, hite Eliyasore ḍakedde"<verse eid="MRK 15:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 15:36"/>Ekzone dũri zaiyore ekkan hani rošot buraiyore hiyan nolor matat gori Isare fi haito diye.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 15:36">Hite hodde, "Tiya! Sai, nobi Eliyase hono hitare uddar goitto aiye ne!"<verse eid="MRK 15:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 15:37"/>Kintu Isaye zure guzoriyore šeš niyaš felaiye. <verse eid="MRK 15:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 15:38"/>Ar dórmogóror forodagan uwottu loti nise foijjonto siri dui bag oi giyegoi. <verse eid="MRK 15:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 15:39"/>Ze Romiyo ofisar Isar sarme tiyai aššil hite Isaye endilla gori šeš niyaš felaiyede deki hodde, "Soiyi, ei manušwa Allar Fut aššil."<verse eid="MRK 15:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 15:40"/>Heṛe hoekzon mayafuwain o dure tiyat aššil, zara in okkol saiye. Hitarar butore aššilde, Salomi, Mogdaleni Moriyam, ar šoṛo Yakub edde Yusesor ma Moriyam. <verse eid="MRK 15:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 15:41"/>Isa Galilor taite ei mayafuwain okkole hibar fise fise zaito edde hibar šeba gorito. Aro bout mayafuwain okkol, zara hibar fũwati uwore Zeruzalem aiššil, hitara o heṛe tiyai aššil.<verse eid="MRK 15:41"/></para>
  <para style="s">Isare hobor diya or</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:57-61">Moti 27:57–61</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:50-56">Luk 23:50–56</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:38-42">Yuhunna 19:38–42</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 15:42"/>He dinnuwa aššilde tiyarir din, mani dórmor dinor agor din, ar hazinna oi giyegoi, <verse eid="MRK 15:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 15:43"/>Arimatiya farar Yusuf, ze ḍõr šobar beši nam gora ekzon montri, hibaye Allar raijjolla boi aššil. Hibaye himmot gori zai Isar laššuwa faibolla Filator hãse foriyad goijje. <verse eid="MRK 15:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 15:44"/>Ar Filat tajjuf oiye ze Isa eto toratori mori giyegoi, ar šenafotire ḍaki Isa morigiyegoide oi ne, hitattu fusar goijje. <verse eid="MRK 15:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 15:45"/>Zehon šenafotir hãsottu hite foriškar zuwab zani faijje, toi laššuwa Yusufore diye. <verse eid="MRK 15:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 15:46"/>Yusufe zai ekkan kafonor hor kinne, toi Isar laš nise lamaiyore he hoorgan beraiyore en ek hoborot raikkegoi, ziba faharor haindat kuinda aššil. Tarfore he hoboror mukot ugguwa fattor gorgorai loizai ouzai diye. <verse eid="MRK 15:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 15:47"/>Hibare hoṛe hobor diye, Mogdaleni Moriyam edde Yusesor ma Moriyame deikke.<verse eid="MRK 15:47"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 15"/>
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="MRK 16"/>
  <para style="s">Isar uwafes zinda</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 28:1-10">Moti 28:1–10</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 24:1-12">Luk 24:1–12</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 20:1-10">Yuhunna 20:1–10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 16:1"/>Dórmor din šeš oi zaigoi bade, Mogdaleni Moriyam, Yakubor ma Moriyam, edde Salomi, hitara Isar lašot ḍoli dito zaibolla kušbo tel kinne. <verse eid="MRK 16:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 16:2"/>Bade haftar foila din binna kub sore, zẽtte hitara hoboror hãse giye hẽtte beil uiṭṭe. <verse eid="MRK 16:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 16:3"/>Hitara ekzone ekzonore hodde, "Hoboror mukottu fattorguware ãra hare diyore šoraiyum?"<verse eid="MRK 16:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 16:4"/>Kintu hitara saiyore dekedde fattorguwa šoraiya. Hiba beši ḍõr aššil. <verse eid="MRK 16:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 16:5"/>Hoboror butore goli hitara dola lamba hor finda ekzon zuwan manušore den ḍakottu boiṛa deikke, henot hitara beši ammuwak oiye.<verse eid="MRK 16:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 16:6"/>Kintu hite hodde, "Ammuwak no oiyo, kurušot diya oiyede Nasarator Isare ze tũwara tuwor, hiba eṛe nai, hiba uṛi giyegoi. So, iyan he zaga ziyanot hitara hibare rakkil. <verse eid="MRK 16:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 16:7"/>Ar tũwara zo, hibar sahabi okkolore edde Fitorore hogoi ze Hiba tũwarar age Galilot zar. Hibaye zendilla hoil he bafe tũwara heṛe hibar deha faiba."<verse eid="MRK 16:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 16:8"/>Toi hitara kissu buzi uṛi no fari ḍore hafi hafi hoborottu niyoli giyegoi edde hentu dai giyegoi. Hitara ei babute ek or hota o honokiyore no ho, kiyollahoile hitara ḍorai gilgoi.<verse eid="MRK 16:8"/></para>
  <para style="s">Isaye Sahabi okkolore deha diye</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="JHN 20:11-18">Yuhunna 20:11–18</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 16:9"/>
    <char style="it">Haftar foila din binna sore, Isa abar uṛizaigoi bade hibaye foila Mogdaleni Moriyamore deha diye, zibattu Isaye hãttuwa but dafail.</char> <verse eid="MRK 16:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 16:10"/><char style="it">Hibaye hentu giyegoi edde he hóborgan zara Isar fũwati takito, hitarare diye edde hitara hainde edde bilag gorat aššil.</char> <verse eid="MRK 16:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 16:11"/><char style="it">Kintu hitara zehon fuinne, ze Isa zinda ase edde hibare deha diye, hitara hiyan biššaš no gore.</char><verse eid="MRK 16:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 16:12"/>
    <char style="it">In okkol goṭi bade, Isaye oinno ruf dori hitarar dui zonore fõtot deha diye, zara baire farat zadde aššil.</char> <verse eid="MRK 16:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 16:13"/><char style="it">Itara o uwafes firi giye edde dusoragunore o he hóbor diye, kintu hitarare o hitara biššaš no gore.</char><verse eid="MRK 16:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 16:14"/>
    <char style="it">Šeše hiba he egarozon asabe hána háibolla dola oiyede šomot hitarare deha diye. Biššašor obaf edde dil dorode hiyanolla hitarare hibaye boka diye, kiyollahoile hiba uṛizaigoi bade zara hibare deikke hitarar hota itara biššaš no gore.</char><verse eid="MRK 16:14"/></para>
  <para style="s">Isar šeš hokum</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 28:18-20">Moti 28:18–20</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 24:47-48">Luk 24:47–48</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 16:15"/>
    <char style="it">Isaye hitarare hodde,<char style="wj">"Duniyair hár mikka zo edde Allar diya kušir hobor hár manuš zatir hãse tobolig goro.</char></char> <verse eid="MRK 16:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 16:16"/><char style="it"><char style="wj">Ze honokiye biššaš gore edde torikotor gusol lo hite uddar faibo. Kintu ze biššaš no goribo, hitare duši ṭora oibo.</char></char> <verse eid="MRK 16:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 16:17"/><char style="it"><char style="wj">Zara biššaš gore hitarar butore ei sinnogun deha zaibo: Ãr name hitara bod ruh dafaibo, hitarar zile noya bášat hota hoibo,</char></char> <verse eid="MRK 16:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 16:18"/><char style="it"><char style="wj">ar hitara hate háf doribo, zodi hitara hono moron biš há, toile hitarar hono hoti no oibo. Ar zẽtte hitara biyaraimmar gat hat rakibo, hitara bala oi zaiboi." </char></char><verse eid="MRK 16:18"/></para>
  <para style="s">Isare asmanot tuli loiza oiye</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 24:50-53">Luk 24:50–53</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 1:9-11">Asab 1:9–11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 16:19"/>
    <char style="it">Malik Isaye hitarar loi hota hoi bade, hibare asmanot tuli loi za oiye edde Allar den ḍakottu boišše.</char><verse eid="MRK 16:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 16:20"/>
    <char style="it">Toi sahabi okkol baire giye edde hár zagat tobolig goijje. Ar Malike hitarar fũwati ham gorat taikke edde hitarare keramoti ham goribar šokti diyore forman goijje ze hibar kalam soiyi.</char> Amen!<verse eid="MRK 16:20"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 16"/>
</usx>
